<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="DAN" style="id" />
  <para style="h">Annabi Daniyɛli</para>
  <para style="toc1">Ala xa masenyi Annabi Daniyɛli bɛ</para>
  <para style="toc2">Annabi Daniyɛli</para>
  <para style="toc3">Dan</para>
  <para style="mt">Ala xa masenyi Annabi Daniyɛli bɛ</para>
  <para style="imt">Masenyi nde yi Kitaabui xa fe ra</para>
  <para style="ip">Annabi Daniyɛli xa Kitaabui fee masenma naxee dangixi Babilɔn bɔxi ma. Ala nu bara a niya Babilɔn mangɛ xa Isirayilakae xanin, e xa lu konyiya kui e xa yunubie xa fe ra. Na mangɛ naxa sɛgɛtala xaranxi ndee tongo, e xa findi a xa walikɛ xungbee ra a xa banxi kui. Annabi Daniyɛli nu na na mixie ya ma.</para>
  <para style="ip">Alatala naxa a masen Babilɔnkae bɛ Daniyɛli saabui ra, sɛnbɛ luma nɛ mixi yi ra naxan Ala xa sɛriyɛ rabatuma tɛmui birin. Daniyɛli to tondi se raharamuxi donde, Ala naxa yalanyi fi a ma dangife a booree ra. A to tondi kuyee batude, Ala naxa a ratanga faxɛ ɲaaxi ma. A to tondi sali rabɛɲinde, Ala naxa a rakisi yɛtɛ xaaɲɛxie ma. Ala naxa kaabanakoe gbegbe raba Daniyɛli saabui ra a xa danxaniya xa fe ra.</para>
  <para style="ip">Bafe na fe mɔɔli ra, yi kitaabui fe gbegbe masenma nɛ mixie bɛ duniɲa ɲɛrɛ ki xa fe ra. Alatala findixi duniɲa mangɛ birin xa mangɛ xungbe nan na. Na kui a duniɲa si mangɛyae raɲɛrɛma nɛ alɔ a wama a xɔn ma ki naxɛ. Na fe toma yi kitaabui kui, a fa findi fahaamui ra won bɛ Ala xa mangɛya xa fe ra. Won nɔma nɛ limaniya sɔtɔde na marakolonyi kui.</para>
  <para style="ip">Ala xa won mali alako won xa fahaamui nun limaniya sɔtɔ yi kitaabui saabui ra. Amina.</para>
  <para style="imte">Ala xa masenyi Annabi Daniyɛli bɛ</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="DAN 1" />
  <para style="s">Annabi Daniyɛli sigafe Babilɔn bɔxi ma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DAN 1:1" />Yudaya mangɛ Yehoyakimi xa mangɛya ɲɛ saxan nde ra, Babilɔn mangɛ Nebukadansari naxa siga Darisalamu gerede, a xa sɔɔrie fa mɛnni rabilin gere ki ma. <verse eid="DAN 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DAN 1:2" />Marigi naxa Yudaya mangɛ Yehoyakimi sa e bɛlɛxɛ, a nun Ala xa hɔrɔmɔbanxi yirabase sɛniyɛnxi ndee. Mangɛ Nebukadansari naxa nee xanin Babilɔn bɔxi ma a xa ala xa banxi kui, naafuli ragatama dɛnnaxɛ.<verse eid="DAN 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="DAN 1:3" />Mangɛ naxa a fala Asipenasi bɛ, a xa walikɛe xa mangɛ, a xa Isirayila fonike ndee sugandi mangɛ xabilɛ ya ma, xa na mu kuntigi denbayae ya ma. <verse eid="DAN 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DAN 1:4" />A xa xaxilima xaranxie sugandi naxee fate yalanxi, naxee tofan, alako e xa nɔ walide mangɛ xa banxi kui, e man xa Babilɔn xui nun a sɛbɛli xɔri xaran. <verse eid="DAN 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DAN 1:5" />Mangɛ naxa donse nun wɛni itaxun e ma, e baloma naxan na ɲɛ saxan bun ma. Na dangi xanbi, e xa so walife mangɛ bɛ. <verse eid="DAN 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DAN 1:6" />Yudayaka naxee nu na e ya ma, nee nan ya: Daniyɛli, Xananiya, Mikayeli, nun Asaraya. <verse eid="DAN 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DAN 1:7" />Mangɛ xa walikɛe xunyi naxa xili nɛɛnɛ sa e xun ma. A naxa Daniyɛli xili sa «Beletesasari.» A naxa Xananiya xili sa «Sadiraki.» A naxa Mikayeli xili sa «Mesaki.» A naxa Asaraya xili sa «Abedinego.»<verse eid="DAN 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="DAN 1:8" />Daniyɛli naxa natɛ tongo a xa a yɛtɛ ratanga mangɛ xa donse raharamuxie nun a xa wɛni ma. A naxa walikɛe xa mangɛ mayandi a xa tin na ra. <verse eid="DAN 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DAN 1:9" />Ala to nu bara a ragiri Daniyɛli xa rafan a ma, walikɛe xa mangɛ naxa diɲɛ a ma. <verse eid="DAN 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DAN 1:10" />A naxa a fala a bɛ, «N bara gaaxu n ma mangɛ ya ra, naxan bara donse nun minse itaxun wo ma. Xa a sa wo to, wo fate baxi wo ma, wo fate mu fan alɔ booree, mangɛ fama nɛ n xunyi bade n dɛ i.»<verse eid="DAN 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="DAN 1:11" />Daniyɛli naxa a kantama yaabi, walikɛe xa mangɛ nu bara naxan ti Daniyɛli, Xananiya, Mikayeli, nun Asaraya xun ma, <verse eid="DAN 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DAN 1:12" />«I xa muxu mato xi fu bun ma. Sansi bogie nun ye gbansan so muxu yi ra. <verse eid="DAN 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DAN 1:13" />Na dangi xanbi, i xa muxu lahalɛ nun booree lahalɛ mato, naxee mangɛ xa donse donma. Na tɛmui, i xa natɛ tongo i rabafe ma.» <verse eid="DAN 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DAN 1:14" />E kantama naxa tin na ra, a xa e mato xi fu bun ma. <verse eid="DAN 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DAN 1:15" />Xi fu to dangi, e lahalɛ nu fan dangi booree ra, naxee nu mangɛ xa donse donma. <verse eid="DAN 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DAN 1:16" />Na nan a toxi, e kantama naxa sansi bogie so e yi ra mangɛ xa donse nun wɛni ɲɔxɔɛ ra.<verse eid="DAN 1:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="DAN 1:17" />Ala naxa fe kolonyi, lɔnni, nun fahaamui fi yi fonike naani ma. Daniyɛli naxa nɔ laamatunyie nun xiyee fasaride. <verse eid="DAN 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DAN 1:18" />Waxati to ɲɔn, mangɛ nu bara naxan fala, walikɛe xa mangɛ naxa e mati Nebukadansari yire. <verse eid="DAN 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DAN 1:19" />Mangɛ xungbe to gɛ wɔyɛnde e ra, a naxa a kolon e maniyɛ mu nu na boore fonikee ya ma. Mixi yo mu a kɛnɛn alɔ Daniyɛli, Xananiya, Mikayeli, nun Asaraya. Na kui, e naxa so walife mangɛ bɛ. <verse eid="DAN 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DAN 1:20" />Mangɛ to e maxɔrin fe kolonyi, lɔnni, nun fahaamui ma, a naxa a kolon e xa yaabie fan Babilɔn karamɔxɔɛe nun sematoe gbe bɛ dɔxɔ fu. <verse eid="DAN 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DAN 1:21" />Daniyɛli naxa lu na wali kui han Sirusi xa mangɛya ɲɛ singe ra.<verse eid="DAN 1:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DAN 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="DAN 2" />
  <para style="s">Mangɛ xa xiye</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DAN 2:1" />Nebukadansari xa mangɛya ɲɛ firin nde ra, a naxa xiye nde sa. A xaxili naxa ifu han a mu nɔ xide. <verse eid="DAN 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DAN 2:2" />A naxa karamɔxɔɛe, sematoee, mandurulae, nun Babilɔn sɛrɛxɛdubɛe xili alako e xa a xa xiye tagiraba a bɛ. E naxa fa, e ti a ya i. <verse eid="DAN 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DAN 2:3" />Mangɛ naxa a masen e bɛ, «N xiye nde nan saxi, naxan bara n xaxili ifu. A xɔli n ma n xa na xiye kui ife kolon.»<verse eid="DAN 2:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="DAN 2:4" />Babilɔn sɛrɛxɛdubɛe naxa mangɛ yaabi Arami xui ra, «Muxu xa Mangɛ, Ala xa simaya fi i ma. I xa xiye yaba i xa konyie bɛ, alako muxu xa na tagiraba i bɛ.» <verse eid="DAN 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DAN 2:5" />Mangɛ naxa a fala sɛrɛxɛdubɛe bɛ, «N ma natɛ tongoxi nan ya: Xa wo mu n ma xiye nun a kui ife tagiraba n bɛ, n wo ibolonma nɛ a xuntun xuntunyie ra, n wo xa banxie fan kana. <verse eid="DAN 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DAN 2:6" />Kɔnɔ xa wo nɔ n ma xiye nun a kui ife tagirabade n bɛ, n harige nun binyɛ gbegbe fima nɛ wo ma. Awa, wo n ma xiye nun a kui ife tagiraba n bɛ keren na.»<verse eid="DAN 2:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="DAN 2:7" />E naxa mangɛ yaabi, «Mangɛ, i xa na xiye masen muxu bɛ alako muxu xa a tagiraba i bɛ.» <verse eid="DAN 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DAN 2:8" />Mangɛ naxa a fala e bɛ, «N a kolon wo wama waxati tongofe a fe ma, barima wo a kolon n mu n ma natɛ tongoxi kanama! <verse eid="DAN 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DAN 2:9" />Kɔnɔ xa wo mu n ma xiye tagiraba n bɛ, wo birin fama nɛ na ɲaxankatɛ sɔtɔde. Wo wama n madaxufe wule nan na han n xa n ma natɛ masara. Wo n ma xiye tagirabama n bɛ na nan ma keren na, alako n xa a kolon wo fata na rabade.»<verse eid="DAN 2:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="DAN 2:10" />Sɛrɛxɛdubɛe naxa mangɛ yaabi, «Mangɛ, mixi yo mu na yi duniɲa bɛndɛ fuɲi fari naxan nɔma yi yaamari rabade. Na nan a toxi mangɛ yo mu na naxan yi fe mɔɔli maxɔrinma a xa karamɔxɔɛe, sematoe, nun sɛrɛxɛdubɛe ma, hali a sɛnbɛ to gboxi. <verse eid="DAN 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DAN 2:11" />I naxan maxɔrinxi, na xɔrɔxɔ. Mixi yo mu nɔma na yaabi sode i yi ra fo alae, kɔnɔ nee mu dɔxɔxi adamadie tagi.»<verse eid="DAN 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="DAN 2:12" />Na kui, mangɛ naxa xɔnɔ e ma, a bɔɲɛ naxa te han a yamari fi Babilɔn lɔnnilae birin xa faxa. <verse eid="DAN 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DAN 2:13" />Mangɛ to yaamari fi lɔnnilae birin xa faxa, xɛɛrae naxa siga Daniyɛli nun a booree fende alako e xa e fan faxa.<verse eid="DAN 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="DAN 2:14" />Mangɛ kantamae xunyi Ariyoki to mini Babilɔn lɔnnilae faxade, <verse eid="DAN 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DAN 2:15" />Daniyɛli naxa a maxɔrin mayandi ra, «Munfe ra mangɛ yi yaamari xɔrɔxɔɛ mɔɔli fixi?» Ariyoki naxa na tagi raba Daniyɛli bɛ. <verse eid="DAN 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DAN 2:16" />Na tɛmui Daniyɛli naxa siga mangɛ yire, a fa a mayandi a xa tɛmui nde fi a ma alako a xa nɔ na xiye nun a kui ife fasaride a bɛ.<verse eid="DAN 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="DAN 2:17" />Daniyɛli naxa siga a xɔnyi, a yi fe birin masen a boore Xananiya, Mikayeli, nun Asaraya bɛ. <verse eid="DAN 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DAN 2:18" />A naxa a fala e bɛ, e xa Koore Ala makula a xa kinikini e ma, a xa yi gundo masen e bɛ, alako Daniyɛli, a booree, nun Babilɔn lɔnnilae birin naxa faxa. <verse eid="DAN 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DAN 2:19" />Na kɔɛ ra, Ala naxa na xiye xa gundo masen Daniyɛli bɛ laamatunyi ra. Daniyɛli naxa Koore Ala tantu <verse eid="DAN 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DAN 2:20" />yi masenyi ra,</para>
  <para style="b" vid="DAN 2:20" />
  <para style="q" vid="DAN 2:20">«Ala xili xa tantu tɛmui birin,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DAN 2:20">dan mu na naxan ma,<verse eid="DAN 2:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="DAN 2:21" />barima a tan nan gbe na fe kolonyi nun sɛnbɛ ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DAN 2:21">A tan nan waxati nun a kɛɲa masarama.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DAN 2:21">A tan nan mangɛe bama,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DAN 2:21">a tan nan mangɛe rasabatima.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DAN 2:21">A lɔnni fima lɔnnilae ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DAN 2:21">a xaxili fanyi fima xaxilimae ma.<verse eid="DAN 2:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="DAN 2:22" />A gundo tilinxi makɛnɛnma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DAN 2:22">a fe nɔxunxi raminima naiyalanyi ra.<verse eid="DAN 2:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="DAN 2:23" />N benbae Marigi Ala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DAN 2:23">n i matɔxɔma, n i tantuma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DAN 2:23">lɔnni nun sɛnbɛ xa fe ra i naxan fixi n ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DAN 2:23">I bara n nakolon fe ma, muxu naxan maxɔrinxi i ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DAN 2:23">i bara muxu rakolon mangɛ xa xiye ra.»<verse eid="DAN 2:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="DAN 2:24" />Na tɛmui Daniyɛli naxa siga Ariyoki yire, mangɛ yaamari fi naxan ma a xa Babilɔn lɔnnilae faxa. A naxa a fala a bɛ, «I naxa Babilɔn lɔnnilae faxa. I xa n mati mangɛ xɔnyi, n xa a xa xiye tagi raba a bɛ.» <verse eid="DAN 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="DAN 2:25" />Ariyoki naxa Daniyɛli mati mangɛ yire keren na, a fa a fala a bɛ, «Mangɛ, n bara Yudayaka nde to na mixi suxuxie ya ma, naxan nɔma i xa xiye tagi rabade.» <verse eid="DAN 2:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="DAN 2:26" />Mangɛ naxa Daniyɛli maxɔrin, naxan xili Beletesasari, «I tan nɔma n ma xiye nun a kui tagirabade n bɛ?»<verse eid="DAN 2:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="DAN 2:27" />Daniyɛli naxa mangɛ yaabi, «Mangɛ, i fe nɔxunxi naxan maxɔrinxi lɔnnilae, sematoe, karamɔxɔɛe, nun mandurulae ma, e mu nɔma na tagirabade. <verse eid="DAN 2:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="DAN 2:28" />Kɔnɔ Ala, naxan na koore ma, a tan nan nɔma fe nɔxunxie makɛnɛnde. A bara Mangɛ Nebukadansari rakolon naxan fama rabade. I xa xiye nun i xa laamatunyie nan ya, i naxan toxi i xa sade ma. <verse eid="DAN 2:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="DAN 2:29" />Mangɛ, i to i sa, i naxa i maɲɔxun fee ma, naxee fama rabade. Na kui, naxan fe nɔxunxie makɛnɛnma, a bara i rakolon fee ma naxee fama rabade. <verse eid="DAN 2:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="DAN 2:30" />Xa yi fe nɔxunxie bara makɛnɛn n bɛ, na mu rabaxi xɛ barima n ma lɔnni to gboxi boore gbe bɛ. Yi bara makɛnɛn n bɛ alako mangɛ xa na kui kolon a naxan maɲɔxunxi a xaxili ma.»<verse eid="DAN 2:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="DAN 2:31" />«Mangɛ, i bara gɛmɛ masolixi belebele to i xa laamatunyi kui. A nu tixi i ya ra, a nu yanbafe, a nu magaaxu. <verse eid="DAN 2:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="DAN 2:32" />A xunyi nu yailanxi xɛɛma ra, a kanke nun a bɛlɛxɛ gbeti ra, a furi nun a tabe yɔxui ra, <verse eid="DAN 2:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="DAN 2:33" />a bɛlɛnyi wure ra, a sanyi wure nun bɛndɛ ra. <verse eid="DAN 2:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="DAN 2:34" />I nu a matofe tɛmui naxɛ, gɛmɛ nde naxa ibɔɔ, kɔnɔ adama bɛlɛxɛ xa mu a bɔɔxi. Gɛmɛ ibɔɔxi naxa sin na gɛmɛ masolixi sanyi ma, naxan nu yailanxi wure nun bɛndɛ ra. A naxa e i wuru. <verse eid="DAN 2:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="DAN 2:35" />Wure yo, bɛndɛ yo, yɔxui yo, gbeti yo, xɛɛma yo, na birin naxa iwuru, a lu alɔ sansi xɔri fenta lonyi ma, foye naxan fama sogofure ra. Kɔnɔ gɛmɛ naxan sinxi gɛmɛ masolixi ma, na naxa findi geya belebele ra, a bɔxi birin nafe.»<verse eid="DAN 2:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="DAN 2:36" />«Xiye nan na ki. Yakɔsi muxu xa a tagiraba mangɛ bɛ. <verse eid="DAN 2:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="DAN 2:37" />Mangɛ, mangɛe xa mangɛ na i tan na, barima Koore Ala nan na mangɛya fixi i ma sɛnbɛ nun binyɛ ra. <verse eid="DAN 2:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="DAN 2:38" />A tan nan i dɔxɔxi mixi, sube, nun xɔni birin xun ma. A bara na nɔɛ fi i ma. Na nan na ki, i tan nan na xɛɛma xunyi ra. <verse eid="DAN 2:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="DAN 2:39" />I na dangi, mangɛya gbɛtɛ kelima nɛ naxan sɛnbɛ xurun i bɛ. Na dangi xanbi, mangɛya saxan nde naxan luma alɔ yɔxui, na fan fama nɛ duniɲa birin yamaride. <verse eid="DAN 2:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="DAN 2:40" />Mangɛya naani nde nan fan fama, naxan xɔrɔxɔ alɔ wure. Wure se birin butuxunma ki naxɛ, na mangɛya fan a booree butuxunma na ki nɛ. <verse eid="DAN 2:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="DAN 2:41" />I bara a sanyie nun a sansolee to. E rafalaxi wure nun bɛndɛ masunbuxi nan na. Na nan a masenxi lanyi mu luma na mangɛya kui. Kɔnɔ sɛnbɛ nde tan luma nɛ na mangɛya kui alɔ na wure xɔrɔxɔɛ a masenma ki naxɛ. <verse eid="DAN 2:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="DAN 2:42" />Sansole naxee yailanxi wure nun bɛndɛ ra, a masenma nɛ a na mangɛya sɛnbɛ gbo, kɔnɔ sɛnbɛ yo mu a ra yire ndee. <verse eid="DAN 2:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="DAN 2:43" />I bara wure nun bɛndɛ masunbuxi to, na findixi na mixie nan na, naxee lanyi xirima e boore tagi, kɔnɔ na lanyi mu xirima a fanyi ra, alɔ wure nun bɛndɛ mu a bore suxuma a fanyi ra ki naxɛ.»<verse eid="DAN 2:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="DAN 2:44" />«Na mangɛe xa waxati, Koore Ala mangɛya nde raminima nɛ naxan mu kanama abadan. Na mangɛya mu luma ɲama gbɛtɛ xa yaamari bun ma. A fama nɛ na mangɛya birin iwurude. A mu kanama abadan. <verse eid="DAN 2:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="DAN 2:45" />Na kui i bara na gɛmɛ to, naxan kelixi geya ma kɔnɔ mixi bɛlɛxɛ xa mu a bɔɔxi. Na gɛmɛ bara wure, yɔxui, bɛndɛ, gbeti, nun xɛɛma iwuru. Ala Xungbe bara mangɛ rakolon yi fee ma naxee fama rabade. Yi xiye nɔndi yati nan a ra. N naxan birin tagirabaxi i bɛ, i lanma i xa la a ra.»<verse eid="DAN 2:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="DAN 2:46" />Na tɛmui Mangɛ Nebukadansari naxa a yatagi rafelen bɔxi ma Daniyɛli bun ma. A naxa yaamari fi a sɛrɛxɛ nun surayi xa ba a bɛ. <verse eid="DAN 2:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="DAN 2:47" />Mangɛ naxa a masen Daniyɛli bɛ, «Wo Marigi Ala xungbo alae birin bɛ, a tan nan na mangɛe birin Marigi ra. A gundoe makɛnɛnma, alɔ a yi gundo makɛnɛnxi i bɛ ki naxɛ.»<verse eid="DAN 2:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="DAN 2:48" />Mangɛ naxa Daniyɛli binya, a naafuli gbegbe fi a ma. A naxa a findi xunyi ra Babilɔn bɔxi nun lɔnnilae birin xun ma. <verse eid="DAN 2:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="DAN 2:49" />Daniyɛli naxa mangɛ maxandi a xa a lu Sadiraki, Mesaki, nun Abedinego fan xa mangɛ wali raba Babilɔn bɔxi ma. Daniyɛli naxa findi mangɛ Nebukadansari rasima ra.<verse eid="DAN 2:49" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DAN 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="DAN 3" />
  <para style="s">Nebukadansari xa kuye</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DAN 3:1" />Mangɛ Nebukadansari naxa kuye nde yailan xɛɛma ra. A xa kuyɛ nɔngɔn ya tongo senni, a xa gboe fan nɔngɔn ya senni. A naxa a ti Dura geya bunyi Babilɔn bɔxi ma. <verse eid="DAN 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DAN 3:2" />Mangɛ Nebukadansari naxa a rasimae, kuntigie, gominae, sɛriyɛsae, naafuli ragatae, sɛbɛlitie, kiitisae, nun bɔxi mangɛdie birin maxili alako e xa fa mangɛ xa kuye mato. <verse eid="DAN 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DAN 3:3" />Awa, mangɛ rasimae, kuntigie, gominae, sɛriyɛsae, naafuli ragatae, sɛbɛlitie, kiitisae, nun bɔxi mangɛdie birin naxa e malan mangɛ xa kuye matode. E naxa ti kuye ya i, Mangɛ Nebukadansari nu bara naxan ti.<verse eid="DAN 3:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="DAN 3:4" />Mangɛ xa xui madangi naxa a fala a xui itexi ra, «Si birin, bɔnsɔɛ birin, xui birin falae, mangɛ xa yaamari nan ya: <verse eid="DAN 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DAN 3:5" />Wo na sarae, xulee, kɔrae, nun maxase mɔɔli birin xui mɛ tɛmui naxɛ, wo xa wo felen bɔxi, wo kuye batu, Mangɛ Nebukadansari naxan yailanxi xɛɛma ra. <verse eid="DAN 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DAN 3:6" />Naxan yo mu bira a bun ma, a a batu, na kanyi wolima nɛ tɛ belebele xɔɔra keren na.»<verse eid="DAN 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="DAN 3:7" />Na nan a to, si nun bɔnsɔɛ birin to sarae, xulee, kɔrae, nun maxase mɔɔli birin xui mɛ, e naxa e felen kuye bɛ, e a batu, Mangɛ Nebukadansari naxan yailanxi xɛɛma ra, a a ti naa.<verse eid="DAN 3:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="DAN 3:8" />Na waxati yati kui, sɛrɛxɛdubɛ ndee naxa fa Yuwifie kalamude. <verse eid="DAN 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DAN 3:9" />E naxa a fala Mangɛ Nebukadansari bɛ, «Mangɛ, simaya xa lu i bɛ! <verse eid="DAN 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DAN 3:10" />I bara yaamari fi mixi birin xa e felen kuye bɛ, e a batu, e na sarae, xulee, kɔrae, nun maxase mɔɔli birin xui mɛ tɛmui naxɛ. <verse eid="DAN 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DAN 3:11" />I man yaamari fixi nɛ a mixi naxan yo mu a felen bɔxi ma, a na kuye batu, na kanyi wolima nɛ tɛ belebele xɔɔra. <verse eid="DAN 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DAN 3:12" />Kɔnɔ Yuwifi ndee na, i bara naxee ti mangɛdie ra Babilɔn bɔxi ma, naxee xili Sadiraki, Mesaki, nun Abedinego, nee bara tondi i xa yaamari rabatude. Mangɛ, e mu i xa alae batufe. Hali yi kuye i naxan yailanxi xɛɛma ra, i a ti be, e mu tinxi a batude!»<verse eid="DAN 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="DAN 3:13" />Nebukadansari bɔɲɛ naxa te, a xɔnɔ a ɲaaxi ra. A naxa yaamari fi e xa fa Sadiraki, Mesaki, nun Abedinego ra. Xɛɛrae naxa fa na xɛmɛe ra mangɛ xɔn. <verse eid="DAN 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DAN 3:14" />Nebukadansari naxa a fala e bɛ, «Sadiraki, Mesaki, nun Abedinego, nɔndi na a ra, wo mu n ma alae batufe, wo man mu yi kuye fan batufe n naxan yailanxi xɛɛma ra, n a ti be? <verse eid="DAN 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DAN 3:15" />Yakɔsi, wo na fa sarae, xulee, kɔrae, nun maxase mɔɔli birin xui mɛde, wo xa wo felen bɔxi ma yi kuye bɛ. N kuye naxan yailanxi, wo xa a batu, xa na mu a ra n wo wolima nɛ tɛ belebele xɔɔra keren na. Ala mundun nɔma wo ratangade n bɛlɛxɛ i?»<verse eid="DAN 3:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="DAN 3:16" />Sadiraki, Mesaki, nun Abedinego naxa Mangɛ Nebukadansari yaabi, «Hali muxu mu muxu yɛtɛ xun mafala. <verse eid="DAN 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DAN 3:17" />Xa wo muxu woli tɛ belebele xɔɔra, muxu Marigi Ala, muxu naxan batuma, na nɔma muxu ratangade i bɛlɛxɛ i. <verse eid="DAN 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DAN 3:18" />Hali a mu sa a raba, mangɛ, i xa a kolon muxu mu nɔma i xa alae batude, muxu mu nɔma muxu felende yi kuye bɛ, i naxan yailanxi xɛɛma ra.»<verse eid="DAN 3:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="DAN 3:19" />Nebukadansari naxa xɔnɔ e ma a ɲaaxi ra, a yatagi naxa masara Sadiraki, Mesaki, nun Abedinego xili ma. Nebukadansari naxa yaamari fi e xa tɛ xa wolenyi xun masa dɔxɔ solofere dangi a forima ki ra. <verse eid="DAN 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DAN 3:20" />A naxa a xa sɔɔri gbangbalanyi ndee yamari, e xa Sadiraki, Mesaki, nun Abedinego xiri, e xa e woli tɛ belebele xɔɔra. <verse eid="DAN 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DAN 3:21" />E naxa na xɛmɛ saxanyi xiri, nun e xa sosee ra, e xa donma xungbee ragoroxi e ma, e e woli tɛ belebele xɔɔra. <verse eid="DAN 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DAN 3:22" />Mangɛ to bara a fala tɛ xa wolenyi xun xa masa, sɔɔri naxee Sadiraki, Mesaki, nun Abedinego woli tɛ xɔɔra, e tan yati naxa gan, e faxa tɛ xa wolenyi ma. <verse eid="DAN 3:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DAN 3:23" />Sadiraki, Mesaki, nun Abedinego naxa bira tɛ belebele xɔɔra, e xirixi.<verse eid="DAN 3:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="DAN 3:24" />Na tɛmui gaaxui naxa mangɛ Nebukadansari suxu, a keli keren na. A a fala a rasimae bɛ, «Won mu mixi xirixi saxan xa woli tɛ xɔɔra?» E naxa mangɛ yaabi, «Iyo mangɛ!» <verse eid="DAN 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="DAN 3:25" />A naxa a fala e bɛ, «Kɔnɔ n mixi naani nan tofe yi ki, e mu xirixi, e na e ɲɛrɛfe tɛ xɔɔra, e mu tɔɔrɔfe hali. Na naani nde tan ɲan maniyɛ malekɛ ra.»<verse eid="DAN 3:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="DAN 3:26" />Nebukadansari naxa a makɔrɛ tɛ belebele ra, a e xili a xui itexi ra, «Sadiraki, Mesaki, Abedinego, Ala Xungbe xa konyie, wo mini, wo fa be.» Sadiraki, Mesaki, nun Abedinego naxa mini tɛ xɔɔra.<verse eid="DAN 3:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="DAN 3:27" />Mangɛ rasimae, kuntigie, gominae, nun mangɛ xa lɔnnilae naxa e maso e ra. E naxa a to, tɛ mu sese rabaxi e fate ra. E xunsɛxɛe nun e xa sosee sese mu ganxi. Tɛ xiri yati mu nu na e ma. <verse eid="DAN 3:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="DAN 3:28" />Nebukadansari naxa a masen, «Tantui na Sadiraki, Mesaki, nun Abedinego Marigi Ala bɛ. A tan nan a xa malekɛ xɛɛxi a xa konyie ratangade. E nu bara la a ra han e naxa tin faxafe ra, alako e naxa mangɛ xa yaamari rabatu, naxan findi ala gbɛtɛ batufe ra bafe e Marigi Ala ra. <verse eid="DAN 3:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="DAN 3:29" />N ma yaamari nɛɛnɛ nan ya: mixi yo fe nde kobi fala Sadiraki, Mesaki, nun Abedinego Marigi Ala bɛ, na kanyi faxama nɛ, a ibolon a xuntun xuntunyie ra, a xa banxi fan kana, barima ala yo mu na bafe Ala ra naxan nɔma mixi ratangade yi mɔɔli ra.»<verse eid="DAN 3:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="DAN 3:30" />Na tɛmui mangɛ naxa Sadiraki, Mesaki, nun Abedinego xa fe mate Babilɔn bɔxi ma.<verse eid="DAN 3:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nebukadansari xa xiye firin nde</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="DAN 3:31" />«Mangɛ Nebukadansari nan yi masenyi tife si birin bɛ, bɔnsɔɛ birin bɛ, xui birin falae bɛ: Bɔɲɛsa xa lu wo bɛ a fanyi ra. <verse eid="DAN 3:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="DAN 3:32" />A lanma n xa tɔnxumae nun kaabanakoe masen wo bɛ, Ala xungbe naxee rabaxi n bɛ.<verse eid="DAN 3:32" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="DAN 3:33" />A xa tɔnxumae wuya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DAN 3:33">a xa kaabanakoe sɛnbɛ gbo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DAN 3:33">A xa mangɛya mu ɲɔnma abadan,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DAN 3:33">danyi mu na a xa bui ma.»<verse eid="DAN 3:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DAN 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="DAN 4" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DAN 4:1" />«N tan Nebukadansari, n nu na n ma mangɛ banxi kui, n bɔɲɛ saxi, n sɛɛwaxi ki fanyi. <verse eid="DAN 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DAN 4:2" />N naxa xiye magaaxuxi nde sa. N naxan maɲɔxunxi, a nun n laamatunyi naxan toxi n ma sade ma, nee bara n nagaaxu ki fanyi. <verse eid="DAN 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DAN 4:3" />N yaamari fi Babilɔn lɔnnilae ma na nan ma e xa fa n yire, alako e xa n ma xiye tagiraba n bɛ.»<verse eid="DAN 4:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="DAN 4:4" />«Karamɔxɔɛe, sematoe, Babilɔn sɛrɛxɛdubɛe, nun mandurulae naxa fa. N naxa n ma xiye yaba e bɛ, kɔnɔ e mu nɔ na tagirabade. <verse eid="DAN 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DAN 4:5" />Daniyɛli naxa fa n yire a dɔnxɔɛ ra, n ma kuye Beletesasari xili saxi naxan xun ma. Ala sɛniyɛnxie xaxili na a bɛ. N naxa n ma xiye madɔxɔ a bɛ.»<verse eid="DAN 4:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="DAN 4:6" />«Beletesasari, karamɔxɔɛe xunyi, n a kolon ala sɛniyɛnxie xaxili na i bɛ. Gundo mu na naxan kolonfe xɔrɔxɔma i bɛ. Awa, i xa n ma laamatunyie tagiraba n bɛ, n naxee toxi xiye kui. <verse eid="DAN 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DAN 4:7" />N nu na n ma sade ma tɛmui naxɛ, n xaxili naxa yi laamatunyie to:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DAN 4:7">Wuri bili itexi nu tixi bɔxi ma,<verse eid="DAN 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="DAN 4:8" />a belebele, a sɛnbɛ gbo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DAN 4:8">A xunyi nu na koore ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DAN 4:8">duniɲa mixi birin nu nɔma a tode.<verse eid="DAN 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="DAN 4:9" />A burɛxɛ nu tofan,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DAN 4:9">a bogi nu wuya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DAN 4:9">a nu mixi birin baloma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DAN 4:9">Wula subee nu e malabuma a niini bun ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DAN 4:9">xɔnie nu e tɛɛ yailanma a salonyie ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DAN 4:9">Daalise birin nu baloe sɔtɔma a ra.»<verse eid="DAN 4:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="DAN 4:10" />«N nu na n ma sade ma tɛmui naxɛ, n xaxili naxa yi laamatunyie to:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DAN 4:10">Sɛniyɛntɔɛ nde naxa keli koore ma,<verse eid="DAN 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="DAN 4:11" />a fa a fala a xui itexi ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DAN 4:11">‹Wo yi wuri rabira,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DAN 4:11">wo xa a salonyie sɛgɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DAN 4:11">wo xa a burɛxɛ ba a ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DAN 4:11">wo xa a bogie rayensen.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DAN 4:11">Sube naxee na a bun, e xa e gi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DAN 4:11">xɔni naxee na a salonyie ma, e xa keli naa.<verse eid="DAN 4:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="DAN 4:12" />Kɔnɔ wo xa a bili xuntunyi nun a sankee lu bɔxi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DAN 4:12">e xirixi yɔlɔnxɔnyi wure daaxi nun yɔxui daaxi ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DAN 4:12">A xa lu xɛ ma ɲooge xɔɔra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DAN 4:12">xini xa a bunda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DAN 4:12">a xa a balo ɲooge ra alɔ subee.<verse eid="DAN 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="DAN 4:13" />Adama xaxili naxan na a bɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DAN 4:13">na masarama nɛ, sube xaxili lu a bɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DAN 4:13">A luma na ki nɛ ɲɛ solofere bun ma.<verse eid="DAN 4:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="DAN 4:14" />Sɛniyɛntɔɛ naxee mixi kantama,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DAN 4:14">nee nan yi natɛ masenxi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DAN 4:14">alako adama birin xa a kolon</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DAN 4:14">a Ala Xungbe nan mangɛyae yamarima.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DAN 4:14">A mangɛya soma mixi yi ra a wama naxan xɔn ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DAN 4:14">hali na mixi xurun birin bɛ.›»<verse eid="DAN 4:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="DAN 4:15" />«N tan, Mangɛ Nebukadansari, n ma xiye nan ya. I tan Beletesasari, i xa na tagiraba n bɛ, barima lɔnnila yo mu na n ma bɔxi ma naxan nɔma na rabade. I tan nan gbansan nɔma na rabade, barima ala sɛniyɛnxie xaxili na i bɛ.»<verse eid="DAN 4:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="DAN 4:16" />Na tɛmui Daniyɛli, naxan xili Beletesasari, a naxa kaaba, a man naxa gaaxu. Mangɛ naxa a fala a bɛ, «Beletesasari, hali i mu gaaxu yi xiye nun a kui ife ya ra.» Beletesasari naxa a yaabi, «N marigi, hali yi xiye nun a kui ife findi i yaxuie gbe ra nu! <verse eid="DAN 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DAN 4:17" />Na wuri bili i naxan toxi, naxan xungbo, a sɛnbɛ gbo, a xunyi koore lima, a toma duniɲa yire birin ma, <verse eid="DAN 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DAN 4:18" />a burɛxɛe tofan, a bogie wuya, a birin rabaloma, subee na naxan bun ma, xɔnie na naxan salonyie kɔn na, <verse eid="DAN 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DAN 4:19" />i tan nan misaalixi na wuri ra. I bara sɛnbɛ gbegbe sɔtɔ, i xa nɔɛ bara gbo han a bara koore li, i xa mangɛya fan bara duniɲa yire birin li. <verse eid="DAN 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DAN 4:20" />I tan mangɛ, i bara sɛniyɛntɔɛ to, a kelima koore ma, a a falama, ‹Wo yi wuri rabira, wo xa a kana, kɔnɔ wo a bili xuntunyi nun a sankee lu bɔxi. Wo a xiri yɔlɔnxɔnyi wure daaxi nun yɔxui daaxi ra. A xa lu xɛ ma ɲooge xɔɔra. Xini xa a bunda. A xa ɲooge don alɔ subee ɲɛ solofere bun ma.›»<verse eid="DAN 4:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="DAN 4:21" />«Mangɛ, n xa na tagiraba i bɛ. Ala Xungbe bara yi natɛ tongo i xa fe ra. <verse eid="DAN 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DAN 4:22" />I kerima nɛ adamadie tagi, i sa lu wulai subee ya ma. I ɲooge maxin alɔ ningee, xini i bunda. I luma na ki nɛ ɲɛ solofere bun ma, han i xa a kolon a Ala Xungbe nan adamadie xa mangɛyae yamarima. A mangɛya fima a kɛnɛn mixi nan ma. <verse eid="DAN 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DAN 4:23" />Wuri bili xuntunyi nun a sankee lufe bɔxi ma, na a masenxi nɛ i bɛ, a i xa mangɛya ragbilenma nɛ i ma. Kɔnɔ na mu rabama han i a kolon a Koore Kanyi nan fe birin yamarima. <verse eid="DAN 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="DAN 4:24" />Na nan a ra mangɛ, i xa tin n ma marasi ra. I xa ba yunubi rabafe. I xa tinxin. I xa kinikini misikiinɛe ma, alako i xa bu bɔɲɛsa kui.»<verse eid="DAN 4:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="DAN 4:25" />Na fe birin naxa kamali Mangɛ Nebukadansari bɛ. <verse eid="DAN 4:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="DAN 4:26" />Kike fu nun firin to dangi, mangɛ nu na a maɲɛrɛfe a xa banxi kui Babilɔn, <verse eid="DAN 4:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="DAN 4:27" />a naxa a fala, «Babilɔn sɛnbɛ gbo de! N tan nan a tixi mangɛ yigiyade ra n yɛtɛ sɛnbɛ xungbe ra, alako n ma binyɛ nun n ma nɔrɛ xa gbo.» <verse eid="DAN 4:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="DAN 4:28" />A fɛfɛ na wɔyɛnyi fala, xui nde naxa keli koore, «Mangɛ Nebukadansari, n xa a fala i bɛ, to n bara i xa mangɛya ba i yi ra. <verse eid="DAN 4:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="DAN 4:29" />I kerima nɛ mixie tagi, i sa lu wulai subee ya ma. I fama ɲooge nan donde alɔ ningee ɲɛ solofere bun ma han i a kolon a Ala Xungbe nan adamadie xa mangɛyae yamarima. A mangɛya soma mixie nan yi ra a wama naxee xɔn.»<verse eid="DAN 4:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="DAN 4:30" />Na wɔyɛnyi naxa kamali Mangɛ Nebukadansari ma keren na. A naxa keri mixie ya ma, a ɲooge don alɔ ningee. Xini naxa a fate bunda, a xunsɛxɛ naxa kuya alɔ sɛgɛ xabee, a sanxalee fan naxa kuya alɔ xɔni sanxalee.<verse eid="DAN 4:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="DAN 4:31" />«Na waxati to ɲɔn, n tan Nebukadansari, n naxa n ya rate koore ma, n xaxili naxa gbilen n ma. N naxa tantui rasiga Ala Xungbe ma, n naxa a matɔxɔ, n naxa a binya, barima Ala na na tɛmui birin, a xa mangɛya mu ɲɔnma abadan, a xa yaamari buma nɛ waxati birin. <verse eid="DAN 4:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="DAN 4:32" />Ala a yɛtɛ waxɔnfe rabama nɛ duniɲa ma hali adama mu tin na ra. A wama naxan xɔn, a na nan nabama adama nun malekɛe ra. Mixi yo mu nɔma a matandide, a fa a fala, ‹I na munse rabafe?› <verse eid="DAN 4:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="DAN 4:33" />N xaxili to gbilen n ma, n ma mangɛya binyɛ nun nɔrɛ fan naxa gbilen n ma. N nasimae nun n ma mixi xungbee naxa n xili, e n dɔxɔ n ma mangɛ kibanyi kui. N sɛnbɛ naxa gbo dangi a singe ra. <verse eid="DAN 4:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="DAN 4:34" />Yakɔsi, n tan Nebukadansari, n Koore Mangɛ tantuma nɛ, n a matɔxɔ, n a binya. A xa kɛwali birin tinxin, a xa kirae birin findixi nɔndi nan na. A tan nan mixi xa fe magoroma, naxan a yɛtɛ igboma.»<verse eid="DAN 4:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DAN 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="DAN 5" />
  <para style="s">Sɛbɛli magaaxuxi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DAN 5:1" />Lɔxɔɛ nde, mangɛ Belisasari naxa xulunyi belebele ti a xa kuntigi wulu bɛ. A naxa wɛni min han <verse eid="DAN 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DAN 5:2" />a siisi fɔlɔ e ya xɔri. Na tɛmui Belisasari naxa yaamari fi e xa fa xɛɛma nun gbeti pɔɔtie ra, a baba Nebukadansari naxee tongoxi Ala xa hɔrɔmɔbanxi kui Darisalamu. Mangɛ bara wa a yɛtɛ, a xa ginɛe, a xa konyi ginɛe, nun a xa kuntigi birin xa na see rawali xulunyi kui. <verse eid="DAN 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DAN 5:3" />E to fa xɛɛma pɔɔtie ra, naxee tongo Ala xa hɔrɔmɔbanxi kui Darisalamu, mangɛ yo, a xa kuntigie yo, a xa ginɛe yo, nun a xa konyi ginɛe, e birin naxa wɛni min nee ra, <verse eid="DAN 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DAN 5:4" />e man fa e xa kuyee batu, naxee yailanxi gbeti, yɔxui, wure, wuri, nun gɛmɛ ra.<verse eid="DAN 5:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="DAN 5:5" />E nu na na rabafe tɛmui naxɛ, mixi bɛlɛxɛsolee naxa mini, a nu sɛbɛli ti banxi kanke, lanpui yatagi. Mangɛ to bɛlɛxɛ to sɛbɛli ti ra, <verse eid="DAN 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DAN 5:6" />a yatagi naxa masara. A naxa gaaxu han a xinbie nu bɔnbɔ e boore ra. <verse eid="DAN 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DAN 5:7" />A naxa sematoe, sɛrɛxɛdubɛe, nun mandurulae xili a xui itexi ra. A naxa a fala Babilɔn lɔnnilae bɛ, «Naxan na yi sɛbɛli xaran, a a fasari n bɛ, n na kanyi maxirima nɛ mangɛ dugi ra, n xɛɛma kɔnmagore ragoro a kɔn ma, n fa sɛnbɛ so a yi ra n ma mangɛya kui a findi mangɛ saxan nde ra n tan nun n fɛmati xanbi ra.»<verse eid="DAN 5:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="DAN 5:8" />Mangɛ xa lɔnnilae birin naxa so, kɔnɔ e mu nɔ na sɛbɛli xarande, e mu nɔ sese fasaride mangɛ bɛ. <verse eid="DAN 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DAN 5:9" />Na kui mangɛ Belisasari naxa gaaxu han a yatagi naxa masara, a xa kuntigie fan naxa ifu.<verse eid="DAN 5:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="DAN 5:10" />Mangɛ xa ginɛ to mangɛ nun a xa kuntigie xui mɛ, a naxa so banxi kui xulunyi nu tife dɛnnaxɛ. A naxa a fala, «Mangɛ, i xa simaya xɔn xa kuya. Hali i mu gaaxu, i yatagi naxa masara. <verse eid="DAN 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DAN 5:11" />Mixi nde na i xa bɔxi ma, ala sɛniyɛnxie xaxili na naxan bɛ. I baba xa waxati, muxu bara a to fahaamula nan na kanyi ra, a xaxili fan, a xa lɔnni luxi nɛ alɔ alae gbe. Na nan a ra, i baba Mangɛ Nebukadansari nu bara a findi karamɔxɔɛe, sematoee, sɛrɛxɛdubɛe, nun mandurulae xunyi ra. I baba, naxan nu mangɛ ra, a tan <verse eid="DAN 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DAN 5:12" />a to nɛ a Daniyɛli, Beletesasari xili saxi naxan xun, a xaxili, a xa fe kolonyi, nun a xa fahaamui fan booree birin bɛ. A nɔma xiye tagirabade, a taali wɔyɛnyi fatanfasi, a maxɔrinyi xɔrɔxɔɛ yaabi. I xa Daniyɛli xili, a fama nɛ yi fe birin tagirabade i bɛ.»<verse eid="DAN 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="DAN 5:13" />Na tɛmui e naxa fa Daniyɛli ra mangɛ yire. Mangɛ naxa a maxɔrin, «I tan nan na Daniyɛli ra, n baba faxi naxan na kelife Yudaya? <verse eid="DAN 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DAN 5:14" />N bara a mɛ a alae xaxili na i bɛ, naxan lɔnni nun fahaamui belebele fima i ma. <verse eid="DAN 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DAN 5:15" />E bara fa lɔnnilae nun karamɔxɔɛe ra, e xa yi sɛbɛli xaran, e xa a fasari n bɛ, kɔnɔ e mu nɔ na rabade. <verse eid="DAN 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DAN 5:16" />N bara a mɛ a i nɔma fee tagi rabade, a nun maxɔrinyi xɔrɔxɔɛ yaabide. Yakɔsi, xa i nɔma yi sɛbɛli xarande, i a fasari n bɛ, n i maxirima mangɛ dugi ra, n xɛɛma kɔnmagore ragoroma i kɔn ma, n fa i findi mangɛ ra naxan dangima birin na, fo n tan nun mangɛ gbɛtɛ, n fɛmati.»<verse eid="DAN 5:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="DAN 5:17" />Daniyɛli naxa mangɛ yaabi, «I xa naafuli ragata i yɛtɛ bɛ, i xa buɲae fi mixi gbɛtɛ ma. N yi sɛbɛli xaranma nɛ mangɛ bɛ, n man a fasari a bɛ. <verse eid="DAN 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DAN 5:18" />Mangɛ, Ala Xungbe nan mangɛya, sɛnbɛ, binyɛ, nun nɔrɛ fixi i baba Nebukadansari ma. <verse eid="DAN 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DAN 5:19" />Na nan a ra, si nun bɔnsɔɛ birin nu sɛrɛnma gaaxui ra i baba ya ra. A na wa naxan faxafe nu, a nu na faxama nɛ. A na wa naxan natangafe nu, a nu na ratangama nɛ. A na wa naxan natefe nu, a nu na ratema nɛ. A na wa naxan nagorofe nu, a nu na ragoroma nɛ. <verse eid="DAN 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DAN 5:20" />Kɔnɔ a to a yɛtɛ igbo a naxa dangi a i, Ala naxa a xa mangɛya nun a nɔrɛ ba a yi ra. <verse eid="DAN 5:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DAN 5:21" />A naxa a keri adamadie ya ma. A adamadi xaxili naxa masara, a findi sube xaxili ra. A naxa lu wula i sofalee fɔxɔ ra, a sɛxɛ don alɔ ningee. Xini nu a fate bunda, han a a kolon a Ala Xungbe nan adamadie xa mangɛyae yamarima, a tan nan mangɛya soma mixi yi ra a wama naxan xɔn.»<verse eid="DAN 5:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="DAN 5:22" />«I tan, a xa di Belisasari, i bara na birin kolon, kɔnɔ i mu i yɛtɛ magoro feo. <verse eid="DAN 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DAN 5:23" />I bara i yɛtɛ ite Koore Marigi xili ma. I bara a xa hɔrɔmɔbanxi pɔɔtie rawali. I tan, i xa kuntigie, i xa ginɛe, i xa konyi ginɛe, wo birin bara wɛni min na pɔɔtie ra. I bara kuyee batu naxee yailanxi gbeti, xɛɛma, yɔxui, wure, wuri, nun gɛmɛ ra. E mu see toma, e mu fee mɛma, e mu sese kolon, kɔnɔ i bara e batu. I xa duniɲɛigiri birin na Ala bɛlɛxɛ i, kɔnɔ i tan mu a tantuma. <verse eid="DAN 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="DAN 5:24" />Na nan a toxi, Ala naxa yi bɛlɛxɛ nun yi sɛbɛli masen i bɛ.»<verse eid="DAN 5:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="DAN 5:25" />«Yi sɛbɛli nan tixi: ‹Mene, mene, tekele, parisin.› <verse eid="DAN 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="DAN 5:26" />Na wama naxan masenfe na nan ya: ‹Mene›, na nan na ki ‹kɔnti›. Ala bara i xa mangɛya lɔxɔɛe kɔnti, a bara danyi sa e ma. <verse eid="DAN 5:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="DAN 5:27" />‹Tekele›, na nan na ki ‹maniyɛ›. Ala bara i maniyɛ, i yelebu. <verse eid="DAN 5:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="DAN 5:28" />‹Parisin› na nan na ki ‹maitaxunyi›. Ala bara i xa mangɛya itaxun Medekae nun Perisekae ma.»<verse eid="DAN 5:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="DAN 5:29" />Belisasari naxa yaamari fi keren na, a Daniyɛli xa maxiri mangɛ dugi ra, a nun xɛɛma kɔnmagore ra, a man xa findi mangɛ saxan nde ra bɔxi birin xun ma.<verse eid="DAN 5:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="DAN 5:30" />Na kɔɛ kerenyi kui mixi nde naxa Babilɔn mangɛ Belisasari faxa.<verse eid="DAN 5:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DAN 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="DAN 6" />
  <para style="s">Ala Daniyɛli ratangafe yɛtɛe ma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DAN 6:1" />Dariyusi Medeka naxa findi mangɛ ra a ɲɛ tongo senni nun firin ma. <verse eid="DAN 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DAN 6:2" />A naxa marasi ti e xa mixi kɛmɛ mixi mɔxɔɲɛn sugandi e xa a xa bɔxi yamari. <verse eid="DAN 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DAN 6:3" />A man naxa mixi saxan ti e xun na, marasitie e dɛntɛgɛma naxee bɛ alako mangɛ xa fe birin xa sɔɔnɛya. Daniyɛli nu na na mixi saxanyie nan ya ma. <verse eid="DAN 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DAN 6:4" />Xaxili fanyi mɔɔli naxan nu Daniyɛli bɛ, na nu dangi marasimae nun e xa mangɛe gbe birin na. Maɲɔxunyi naxa lu mangɛ bɛ a Daniyɛli xa a xa bɔxi birin yamari.<verse eid="DAN 6:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="DAN 6:5" />Na xa fe ra, boore yareratie nun marasimae naxa kata e xa Daniyɛli kalamu a xa mangɛ wali kui, kɔnɔ e mu tantanyi yo to a ra. A nu tinxin, e dugutɛgɛ na a ra, a fata walide. <verse eid="DAN 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DAN 6:6" />Na tɛmui e naxa a fala, «Won mu kalamui yo toma Daniyɛli mabiri, fo a Marigi Ala xa sɛriyɛ kui.»<verse eid="DAN 6:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="DAN 6:7" />Na kui marasimae nun e xunyie naxa siga keren na mangɛ yire, e fa a fala a bɛ, «Mangɛ Dariyusi, simaya xa lu i bɛ. <verse eid="DAN 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DAN 6:8" />I xa bɔxi mangɛe, mangɛ rasie, gominae, nun kuntigie birin a maɲɔxunxi a a lanma yi tɔnyi xa dɔxɔ: ‹Mixi yo naxan tuubima ala nde bɛ, xa na mu a ra mixi nde bɛ, bafe i tan mangɛ ra xi tongo saxan bun ma, na kanyi xa raso yɛtɛe tagi.› <verse eid="DAN 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DAN 6:9" />Yakɔsi mangɛ, i xa tin yi tɔnyi ra, i xa i bɛlɛxɛ fɔxi sa a ma alako a xa findi yaamari ra naxan mu masarama alɔ Medekae nun Perisekae darixi a ra ki naxɛ.» <verse eid="DAN 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DAN 6:10" />Mangɛ Dariyusi naxa a bɛlɛxɛ fɔxi sa kɛɛdi ma yaamari sɛbɛxi a ma, a a findi tɔnyi ra.<verse eid="DAN 6:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="DAN 6:11" />Daniyɛli to a kolon a mangɛ nu bara a bɛlɛxɛ fɔxi sa na yaamari kɛɛdi ma, a naxa te a xɔnyi. A xa wundɛri nu rabixi Darisalamu mabiri. Sanmaya saxan lɔxɔ yo lɔxɔ a nu a xinbi sinma, a a Marigi Ala maxandi, a a matɔxɔ alɔ a nu darixi a ra ki naxɛ. <verse eid="DAN 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DAN 6:12" />Yi mixie naxa siga a xɔnyi keren na, e fa li a na a tuubife a Marigi Ala bɛ maxandi kui.<verse eid="DAN 6:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="DAN 6:13" />E naxa siga mangɛ yire keren na, e fa a maxɔrin a xa yaamari ma, «Mangɛ i mu tɔnyi dɔxɔ xɛ a mixi yo naxan tuubima ala nde bɛ, xa na mu a ra mixi nde bɛ, bafe i tan na xi tongo saxan bun ma, a na kanyi xa raso yɛtɛe tagi.» Mangɛ naxa e yaabi, «Iyo. Yaamari na a ra naxan mu masarama alɔ Medekae nun Perisekae darixi a ra ki naxɛ.» <verse eid="DAN 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DAN 6:14" />E naxa fa a fala mangɛ bɛ, «Mangɛ, Daniyɛli naxan kelixi Yudaya a mu i xui binyaxi, a mu i xa yaamari suxuxi. A Ala maxandima sanya saxan lɔxɔ yo lɔxɔ.»<verse eid="DAN 6:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="DAN 6:15" />Na wɔyɛnyi naxa mangɛ tɔɔrɔ ki fanyi ra. A nu wama Daniyɛli ratangafe sɛriyɛ ma. A naxa fe birin naba beenun kɔɛ xa so alako Daniyɛli xa kisi. <verse eid="DAN 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DAN 6:16" />Kɔnɔ na xɛmɛe man naxa siga mangɛ yire, e fa a fala a bɛ, «Mangɛ, i xa ratu Medekae nun Perisekae xa sɛriyɛ ma. Mangɛ xa sɛriyɛ mu nɔma masarade.» <verse eid="DAN 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DAN 6:17" />Na kui Mangɛ naxa yaamari fi e xa Daniyɛli woli yɛtɛe tagi. Mangɛ naxa a fala Daniyɛli bɛ, «I Marigi Ala, i birama naxan fɔxɔ ra tunnabɛxiya kui, a xa i rakisi.» <verse eid="DAN 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DAN 6:18" />E naxa gɛmɛ xungbe sa yɛtɛe yire naadɛ ra, mangɛ fan naxa a xa tɔnxuma sa naadɛ ma a xa xurundɛ ra, alako sese naxa masara Daniyɛli xa fe ra. Kuntigie fan naxa na raba.<verse eid="DAN 6:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="DAN 6:19" />Mangɛ naxa gbilen a xɔnyi. A mu a dɛge, a mu tin fefe rabade, na kɔɛ birin a mu xi feo. <verse eid="DAN 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DAN 6:20" />Kuye to iba, a naxa kurun, a siga yɛtɛe yire. <verse eid="DAN 6:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DAN 6:21" />A to mɛnni li, a naxa Daniyɛli xili a xui makinikinixi ra, «Daniyɛli, Ala ɲiɲɛ xa konyi. I Marigi Ala, i birama naxan fɔxɔ ra tunnabɛxiya kui, a bara nɔ i ratangade yɛtɛe ma?» <verse eid="DAN 6:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DAN 6:22" />Daniyɛli naxa mangɛ yaabi, «Mangɛ, i xa simaya xɔn xa kuya. <verse eid="DAN 6:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DAN 6:23" />N Marigi Ala bara a xa malekɛ xɛɛ yɛtɛe dɛe balande. E mu n tɔɔrɔ fefe ma, barima Ala a kolon a n mu fe ɲaaxi yo rabaxi. Hali i tan mabiri mangɛ, n mu fe kobi yo rabaxi.» <verse eid="DAN 6:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="DAN 6:24" />Mangɛ naxa sɛɛwa ki fanyi, a fa yaamari fi e xa Daniyɛli rate naa kui. E to na raba, e naxa a to a fate mu maxɔnɔxi, barima a nu bara la a Marigi Ala ra. <verse eid="DAN 6:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="DAN 6:25" />Mangɛ naxa yaamari fi, a na xɛmɛ naxee Daniyɛli kalamu, e xa woli yɛtɛe tagi, e nun e xa ginɛe nun e xa die ra. Beenu e xa yili bɔtini li, yɛtɛe nu bara gɛ e faxade, e e xɔri birin magira.<verse eid="DAN 6:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="DAN 6:26" />Na dangi xanbi, Mangɛ Dariyusi naxa yaamari sɛbɛ sie nun bɔnsɔɛe birin ma, a nun xui birin falae naxee na duniɲa ma, «Bɔɲɛsa fanyi xa lu wo bɛ. <verse eid="DAN 6:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="DAN 6:27" />N bara n ma mangɛya birin yaamari, wo xa gaaxu Daniyɛli Marigi Ala ya ra, wo xa a binya.»</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DAN 6:27">«Ala ɲiɲɛ na a ra. A na na tɛmui birin.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DAN 6:27">A xa mangɛya mu kanama abadan.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DAN 6:27">A xa yaamari buma nɛ han duniɲa ɲɔn.<verse eid="DAN 6:27" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="DAN 6:28" />A tan nan mixi rakisima, a e ratanga.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DAN 6:28">A tɔnxumae nun kaabanakoe rabama koore nun bɔxi ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DAN 6:28">A tan nan Daniyɛli ratangaxi yɛtɛe ma.»<verse eid="DAN 6:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="DAN 6:29" />Daniyɛli xa munafanyi xun naxa masa Dariyusi nun Sirusi Periseka xa mangɛyae bun ma.<verse eid="DAN 6:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DAN 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="DAN 7" />
  <para style="s">Daniyɛli xa laamatunyi: Sube naani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DAN 7:1" />Belisasari xa mangɛya ɲɛ singe ra Babilɔn, Daniyɛli naxa xiye sa, laamatunyie naxa ragoro a ma a saxi tɛmui naxɛ. Na dangi xanbi, a naxa na xiye kui ife sɛbɛ. <verse eid="DAN 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DAN 7:2" />Daniyɛli naxa a fala, «N bara laamatunyi to xiye kui kɔɛ ra, foye kelixi koore ma duniɲa tunxun naanie ra, a din baa ra, a a i maxa.»<verse eid="DAN 7:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="DAN 7:3" />«Sube magaaxuxi naani naxa mini baa ma, e sese keren mu a ra. <verse eid="DAN 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DAN 7:4" />A singe nu luxi nɛ alɔ yɛtɛ, sɛgɛ gabutenyie na naxan ma. N a to nɛ, e a gabutenyie italama, e a ti bɔxi ma alɔ mixi, e adama sondonyi raso a fate.»<verse eid="DAN 7:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="DAN 7:5" />«Sube firin nde nu luxi nɛ alɔ wulai bare xungbe. A saxi a sɛɛti ma, ganyanxɔri saxan na a dɛ i, a e xinma. E naxa a fala a bɛ, ‹Keli, i xa sube gbegbe don.›»<verse eid="DAN 7:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="DAN 7:6" />«Na dangi xanbi, n naxa sube nde to naxan luxi alɔ baratɛ, kɔnɔ xɔni gabutenyi naani na a bɛ, xunyi naani fan na a bɛ. A naxa nɔɛ sɔtɔ. <verse eid="DAN 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DAN 7:7" />Na dangi xanbi, n naxa sube naani nde to xiye kui kɔɛ ra. Na fan nu magaaxu ki fanyi, a gbangbalan han. A nu sube donma a wure ɲinyi gbangbalanyie nan na, sube dɔnxɔɛ naxan lu, a naxa na maboron a sanyi ra. A tan mu nu luxi alɔ sube booree. Feri fu nu na a xunyi ma. <verse eid="DAN 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DAN 7:8" />N to n ya rasiga n xa a ferie igbɛ, feri lanmadi naxa mini booree tagi. Feri saxanyie naxa tala na feri lanmadi ya ra. Ya nu na na feri bɛ naxee nu luxi alɔ adamadi yae. Dɛ fan nu na na feri bɛ, naxan nu na yɛtɛ igboe wɔyɛnyie falafe.»<verse eid="DAN 7:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="DAN 7:9" />«N naxa a to, kibanyie dɔxɔxi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DAN 7:9">Ala, fɔlɛ mu na naxan bɛ, a naxa a magoro.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DAN 7:9">A xa dugi birin fiixɛ alɔ xiɲɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DAN 7:9">a xunsɛxɛ luxi alɔ gɛsɛ fute,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DAN 7:9">a xa kibanyi luxi nɛ alɔ tɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DAN 7:9">sanyi digilinxie nu na a xa kibanyi ma.<verse eid="DAN 7:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="DAN 7:10" />Xure tɛ nu goroma a ya ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DAN 7:10">Mixi wulu wulu nu na a batufe.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DAN 7:10">Mixi wulu wulu nu tixi a ya ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DAN 7:10">Kiitisae naxa e magoro, e bukie rabi.<verse eid="DAN 7:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="DAN 7:11" />N naxa a to, na feri lanmadi nu na yɛtɛ igboe wɔyɛnyie falafe.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DAN 7:11">N naxa a to, e sube naani nde faxaxi n ya xɔri,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DAN 7:11">e fa a binbi wɔlɛ tɛ xɔɔra, a xa gan.<verse eid="DAN 7:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="DAN 7:12" />Sɛnbɛ naxa ba sube booree yi ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DAN 7:12">kɔnɔ waxati nde naxa sa e xa simaya tan xun ma.<verse eid="DAN 7:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="DAN 7:13" />N naxa a to xiye kui kɔɛ ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DAN 7:13">Adamadi maniyɛ kelima nuxui fari,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DAN 7:13">a a masoma Ala ra, fɔlɛ mu na naxan bɛ.<verse eid="DAN 7:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="DAN 7:14" />Ala naxa sɛnbɛ, binyɛ, nun mangɛya so a yi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DAN 7:14">alako sie birin, bɔnsɔɛ birin, nun xui birin falɛe</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DAN 7:14">xa lu a xa yaamari bun ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DAN 7:14">A xa yaamari mu ɲɔnma abadan,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DAN 7:14">a xa mangɛya buma nɛ tɛmui birin,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DAN 7:14">danyi yo mu na a ma.»<verse eid="DAN 7:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="DAN 7:15" />«N tan Daniyɛli, n xaxili naxa ifu, n ma xiye naxa n magaaxu. <verse eid="DAN 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DAN 7:16" />N naxa n maso mixi nde ra naxan nu na mɛnni n ma xiye kui, n naxa a maxɔrin, a xa na fe fiixɛ n bɛ. <verse eid="DAN 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DAN 7:17" />A naxa na tagi raba n bɛ, ‹Yi sube magaaxuxi naanie, duniɲa mangɛ naani nan na e ra naxee fama bulade bɔxi ma. <verse eid="DAN 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DAN 7:18" />Kɔnɔ Ala Xungbe xa sɛniyɛntɔɛe fama nɛ mangɛya sɔtɔde, a mu bama e yi ra abadan.›»<verse eid="DAN 7:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="DAN 7:19" />«Na dangi xanbi, n naxa wa na sube naani nde xa fe fahaamufe. A mu nu luxi alɔ sube booree. A magaaxu, wure ɲinyie nun yɔxui sanxalee nan nu na a bɛ. A na gɛ sube donde, a naxan luma, a na maboronma nɛ. <verse eid="DAN 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DAN 7:20" />N man naxa wa na feri xa fe kolonfe. Feri fu nu na a xunyi ma, kɔnɔ feri gbɛtɛ to mini, feri saxan naxa bira na feri booree ya ra. Ya nu na feri bɛ, a dɛ fan nu na yɛtɛ igboe wɔyɛnyie falafe. A nu gbo boore feri birin bɛ.»<verse eid="DAN 7:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="DAN 7:21" />«N naxa na feri to sɛniyɛntɔɛe gere ra, a naxa nɔ e ra, <verse eid="DAN 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DAN 7:22" />han Ala Xungbe, fɔlɛ mu na naxan bɛ, na fa kiiti sade e tagi tɛmui naxɛ, a fa nɔndi fi a xa sɛniyɛntɔɛe ma, alako e xa mangɛya sɔtɔ.»<verse eid="DAN 7:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="DAN 7:23" />«A naxa na fasari n bɛ yi ki, ‹Na sube naani nde findixi duniɲa mangɛya nde nan na, naxan mu luxi alɔ boore mangɛyae. A fama nɛ duniɲa birin sɔtɔde, a a halaki, a a maboron. <verse eid="DAN 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="DAN 7:24" />Na feri fu findixi mangɛ fu nan na, naxee fama tide na mangɛya xun ma. E na dangi, mangɛ gbɛtɛ tima nɛ. A mu luma alɔ e tan, a fama mangɛ saxan nagorode. <verse eid="DAN 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="DAN 7:25" />A wɔyɛnma nɛ Ala Xungbe xili ra, a sɛniyɛntɔɛe ɲaxankata, a wa waxatie nun sɛriyɛe masarafe. Sɛniyɛntɔɛe fama nɛ lude a bɛlɛxɛ waxati saxan nun a tagi bun ma. <verse eid="DAN 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="DAN 7:26" />Na dangi xanbi, kiiti sama nɛ, mangɛya bama nɛ a yi ra, a halaki kerenyi ra. <verse eid="DAN 7:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="DAN 7:27" />Mangɛya, yaamari, nun binyɛ naxan birin na duniɲa, na fama nɛ fide Ala Xungbe xa sɛniyɛntɔɛe ma. Ala xa mangɛya mu ɲɔnma abadan. Sɛnbɛ kanyi birin fama nɛ a xa yaamari suxude, e a rabatu.›»<verse eid="DAN 7:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="DAN 7:28" />«Masenyi danyi nan yi ki. N tan Daniyɛli, n naxa gaaxu n ma maɲɔxunyie ra han n yatagi naxa masara. N naxa yi masenyi birin nagata n bɔɲɛ ma.»<verse eid="DAN 7:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DAN 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="DAN 8" />
  <para style="s">Daniyɛli xa laamatunyi: yɛxɛɛ kontonyi nun sikɔtɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DAN 8:1" />Mangɛ Belisasari xa mangɛya ɲɛ saxan nde ra, n tan Daniyɛli naxa xiye gbɛtɛ sa. <verse eid="DAN 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DAN 8:2" />N nu na Suse nɛ, Elama bɔxi mangɛ taa, xure nde dɛ ra naxan xili «Ulayi xure.» <verse eid="DAN 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DAN 8:3" />N to n ya rakeli, n yɛxɛɛ kontonyi nan to, a tixi xure dɛ ra. Feri kuye firin nu na a xunyi. Naxan bula a dɔnxɔɛ ra, na nu kuya boore bɛ. <verse eid="DAN 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DAN 8:4" />N naxa yɛxɛɛ kontonyi to, a kuye bɔtima a ferie ma sogegorode biri, kɔɔla biri, nun yirefanyi biri. Sube yo mu nu nɔma tide a kanke, birin nu na a xa nɔɛ nan bun ma. A nu a waxɔnfe birin nabama, a sɛnbɛ fan nu gboma nan tui.<verse eid="DAN 8:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="DAN 8:5" />N nu na n maɲɔxunfe na ma tɛmui naxɛ, sikɔtɛ nde naxa fa keli sogegorode. A naxa bɔxi birin iɲɛrɛ, kɔnɔ a sanyi mu din bɔxi ra. Feri magaaxuxi nde nu na a yae tagi. <verse eid="DAN 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DAN 8:6" />A naxa fa han yɛxɛɛ kontonyi feri firin kanyi yire, n naxan to xure dɛ ra. A naxa a gi, a bɔnbɔ a ra a sɛnbɛ birin na. <verse eid="DAN 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DAN 8:7" />N naxa a to a yɛxɛɛ kontonyi gerema, a naxa a feri firinyi kana. Kontonyi mu nɔ a ra. Sikɔtɛ naxa a rabira bɔxi, a a maboron, mixi yo mu nɔ e tagi ibade.<verse eid="DAN 8:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="DAN 8:8" />Sikɔtɛ naxa xungbo a fanyi ra, kɔnɔ a sɛnbɛ to gbo, a feri magaaxuxi naxa gira. Feri magaaxuxi naani gbɛtɛ naxa bula a ɲɔxɔɛ ra. E ya nu rafindixi duniɲa tunxun naanie biri ra.<verse eid="DAN 8:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="DAN 8:9" />Feri lanmadi naxa mini feri nde ma, a kuya fɔlɔ yirefanyi biri, sogetede biri, nun bɔxi nde mabiri ra naxan tofan bɔxi birin bɛ. <verse eid="DAN 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DAN 8:10" />A naxa kuya han a te koore malekɛ galie xili ma. A naxa na malekɛ ndee nun tunbui ndee rabira bɔxi ma, a e maboron. <verse eid="DAN 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DAN 8:11" />A naxa a yɛtɛ ite han koore malekɛ galie xa mangɛ fan xili ma, a fa na mangɛ xa sɛrɛxɛ ba a yi ra, naxan nu bama lɔxɔ yo lɔxɔ. A man naxa a xa yire sɛniyɛnxi fan mabere. <verse eid="DAN 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DAN 8:12" />Koore malekɛ galie naxa lu sikɔtɛ xa nɔɛ bun. Sɛrɛxɛ naxan nu bama lɔxɔ yo lɔxɔ, na fan naxa kana matandi saabui ra. Feri naxa nɔndi wɔlɛ. A xa fe naxa sɔɔnɛya.<verse eid="DAN 8:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="DAN 8:13" />N naxa sɛniyɛntɔɛ nde xui mɛ, a wɔyɛnfe a boore sɛniyɛntɔɛ bɛ, «Yi laamatunyi naxan findixi sɛrɛxɛ kanafe ra, tinxintareya xa gbaloe, yire sɛniyɛnxi maberefe, nun koore malekɛ galie lufe na nɔɛ bun, e maboron, na birin buma xi yire?» <verse eid="DAN 8:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DAN 8:14" />A naxa n yaabi, «Xi wulu keren xi kɛmɛ xi tongo suuli, na dangi xanbi, na yire sɛniyɛnxi man nasɛniyɛnma nɛ.»<verse eid="DAN 8:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="DAN 8:15" />N tan Daniyɛli, n to nu na laamatunyi xa fe maɲɔxunma, alako n xa a fahaamu, daali nde naxa ti n ya i naxan nun mixi maniyɛ. <verse eid="DAN 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DAN 8:16" />N naxa mixi nde xui mɛ keli xure ra naxan xili «Ulayi xure,» a a falama a xui itexi ra, «Yibirila, laamatunyi tagiraba a bɛ.» <verse eid="DAN 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DAN 8:17" />A naxa a maso n na. N naxa gaaxu a ya ra ki fanyi, n nan n felen bɔxi ma. A naxa a fala n bɛ, «Adamadi, i xa a kolon yi laamatunyi waxati dɔnxɔɛ nan ma fe masenma.» <verse eid="DAN 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DAN 8:18" />A nu wɔyɛnfe n bɛ tɛmui naxɛ, n naxa matu a ra, n nan n yatagi rafelen bɔxi ma, kɔnɔ a naxa a bɛlɛxɛ din n na, a n nakeli.<verse eid="DAN 8:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="DAN 8:19" />A man naxa a fala n bɛ, «N xa i rakolon fe ma naxan fama rabade xɔnɛ ɲɔn tɛmui, barima waxati bara sugandi na ɲɔnfe ma. <verse eid="DAN 8:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DAN 8:20" />I yɛxɛɛ kontonyi feri firinyie naxee toxi, nee misaalixi Mede nun Perise mangɛe nan na. <verse eid="DAN 8:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DAN 8:21" />Sikɔtɛ xabe kanyi tan misaalixi Girɛki bɔxi mangɛ nan na. Feri belebele naxan na a yatagi, na misaalixi mangɛ singe nan na. <verse eid="DAN 8:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DAN 8:22" />Feri singe to gira, feri naani naxa mini a ɲɔxɔɛ ra. Nee misaalixi na bɔxi mangɛya naanie nan na, kɔnɔ e sɛnbɛ mu gbo alɔ na singe.»<verse eid="DAN 8:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="DAN 8:23" />«Na mangɛyae na ɲɔn, yunubitɔɛe xa fe kobie na kamali, mangɛ gbɛtɛ kelima nɛ, a a yɛtɛ igbo, a mixie madaxu. <verse eid="DAN 8:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="DAN 8:24" />A sɛnbɛ fama nɛ gbode, kɔnɔ na mu kelima a tan xa ma. A gbaloe magaaxuxie rabama nɛ, a waxɔnfe birin sɔɔnɛyama nɛ, a sɛnbɛmae nun sɛniyɛntɔɛe halakima nɛ. <verse eid="DAN 8:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="DAN 8:25" />A a yɛtɛ igboma nɛ a xa naafuli nun a xa yanfanteya xa fe ra. A mixi gbegbe faxama nɛ, naxee bɔɲɛ nu saxi. A kelima nɛ mangɛe xa mangɛ xili ma. Kɔnɔ na birin dangi xanbi, a fama nɛ halakide, halaki naxan mu kelixi adama ma. <verse eid="DAN 8:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="DAN 8:26" />Na laamatunyi naxan xi xasabi xa fe falaxi, na mu kanama, kɔnɔ i xa a ragata gundo ra, barima a tɛmui xɔnnakuye nan ma fe masenma.»<verse eid="DAN 8:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="DAN 8:27" />«N tan Daniyɛli, n sɛnbɛ birin naxa ɲɔn, n man fa fura xi wuyaxi bun ma. N to yalan, n naxa keli, n fa mangɛ xa walie suxu. Na laamatunyi naxa n ifu, n mu nɔ a fahaamude.»<verse eid="DAN 8:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DAN 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="DAN 9" />
  <para style="s">Daniyɛli Ala maxandife</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DAN 9:1" />Dariyusi, Asuyerusu xa di naxan keli Mede bɔnsɔɛ, a naxa findi Kalidi mangɛ ra. <verse eid="DAN 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DAN 9:2" />A xa mangɛya ɲɛ singe, n tan Daniyɛli, n naxa a kolon kitaabui saabui ra a Alatala nu bara a fala Annabi Yeremi bɛ, a Darisalamu xa kasarɛ buma nɛ ɲɛ tongo solofere. <verse eid="DAN 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DAN 9:3" />Na na a to, n naxa sunyi suxu, n sunnun donma ragoro n ma, n tɛ xube maso n xunyi ma, n naxa n ya rafindi n Marigi Ala ma, n a maxandi.<verse eid="DAN 9:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="DAN 9:4" />N naxa n Marigi Alatala maxandi yi ki, «N Marigi Ala, naxan sɛnbɛ gbo, naxan magaaxu, naxan a xa saatɛ rakamalima, naxan hinnɛma a xanuntenyie ra nun a fɔxirabirɛe ra, <verse eid="DAN 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DAN 9:5" />muxu bara yunubi raba, muxu bara tantan, muxu bara findi mixi ɲaaxi nun matandilae ra, muxu bara gbilen i xa sɛriyɛ nun i xa yaamarie fɔxɔ ra. <verse eid="DAN 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DAN 9:6" />Muxu mu i xa konyie xui suxu, i xa namiɲɔnmɛ naxee wɔyɛn i xili ra muxu xa mangɛe bɛ, a nun muxu xa mangɛdie, muxu babae, nun muxu xa ɲama birin bɛ.»<verse eid="DAN 9:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="DAN 9:7" />«I tan Marigi, i tinxin, kɔnɔ muxu nu bara i yanfa. To lɔxɔɛ muxu birin yaagixi na nan ma, Yudayakae, Darisalamukae, Isirayilakae, naxee na be, naxee na yire makuye, naxee na ɲamanɛ birin i muxu rayensenxi dɛnnaxɛ. <verse eid="DAN 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DAN 9:8" />Alatala, muxu birin yaagixi, muxu xa mangɛe, muxu xa mangɛdie, nun muxu babae. Muxu yaagixi barima muxu bara yunubi raba i ra. <verse eid="DAN 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DAN 9:9" />Kɔnɔ i tan muxu Marigi Ala, i bara hinnɛ muxu ra, i bara diɲɛ muxu ma, hali muxu to i matandi. <verse eid="DAN 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DAN 9:10" />Muxu mu muxu Marigi Alatala xui suxu. Muxu mu bira a xa sɛriyɛ fɔxɔ ra, a naxan masenxi a xa konyi namiɲɔnmɛe saabui ra. <verse eid="DAN 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DAN 9:11" />Isirayila ɲama birin bara i xa sɛriyɛ matandi, muxu bara muxu makuya i ra, muxu mu i xui suxu.»</para>
  <para style="p" vid="DAN 9:11">«Na nan a ra, dankɛ naxee sɛbɛxi Tawureta Munsa kui a bara goro muxu ma. Muxu bara Ala xa konyi Munsa xa sɛriyɛ kana, na bara findi yunubi ra muxu bɛ Ala mabiri. <verse eid="DAN 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DAN 9:12" />I naxan fala muxu xa fe ra, a nun muxu xa mangɛ xa fe ra, naxee nu muxu yamarima, i bara na wɔyɛnyi rakamali. I bara muxu ɲaxankata a ɲaaxi ra. I naxan nabaxi Darisalamu ra, ɲama yo mu nu na ɲaxankatɛ mɔɔli singe sɔtɔ. <verse eid="DAN 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DAN 9:13" />Na tɔɔrɛ birin bara muxu li alɔ Tawureta Munsa a masenxi ki naxɛ. Kɔnɔ muxu mu muxu Marigi Alatala maxandi, muxu mu gbilen muxu xa fe ɲaaxie fɔxɔ ra, muxu mu i xa nɔndi suxu. <verse eid="DAN 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DAN 9:14" />Na nan a ra, Alatala bara yi tɔɔrɛ ragoro muxu ma, barima muxu Marigi Alatala xa kɛwali tinxin, kɔnɔ muxu mu a xui suxu.»<verse eid="DAN 9:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="DAN 9:15" />«Muxu Marigi Ala, i bara i xa ɲama ramini Misira bɔxi ma i bɛlɛxɛ sɛnbɛma ra. Han to i xili itexi falama na xa fe ra. Kɔnɔ muxu tan bara yunubi raba, muxu bara yunubi sɔtɔ. <verse eid="DAN 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DAN 9:16" />Marigi, i to darixi fe tinxinxie raba ra, i xa diɲɛ Darisalamu nun i xa geya sɛniyɛnxi ma. I bɔɲɛ xa xinbeli, i naxa xɔnɔ. Muxu xa yunubie nun muxu babae xa yunubie bara Darisalamuka birin nayaagi muxu dɔxɔbooree xɔn ma.»<verse eid="DAN 9:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="DAN 9:17" />«Yakɔsi, muxu Marigi Ala, yandi, i xa i xa konyi xa dubɛ suxu, i xa tin yi maxandi ra i xili fanyi xa fe ra. I xa i xa nɔrɛ ragoro i xa hɔrɔmɔbanxi ma, naxan birin kanaxi. <verse eid="DAN 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DAN 9:18" />N Marigi Ala, i tuli mati n na. I xa muxu xa taa kanaxi mato, i xili saxi naxan xun ma. Muxu mu i maxandima muxu xa kɛwali tinxinxie xa saabui ra. Muxu i maxandima i xa kinikini xungbe nan saabui ra. <verse eid="DAN 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DAN 9:19" />Marigi, i xa muxu xa dubɛ suxu. Marigi, i xa diɲɛ. Marigi, i xa i ɲɛngi sa muxu xɔn ma. N Marigi Ala, i naxa dugundi, fe nde raba i xili fanyi xa fe ra, barima i xili saxi yi taa nun yi ɲama nan xun ma.»<verse eid="DAN 9:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="DAN 9:20" />N naxa wɔyɛn n Marigi Alatala bɛ, n naxa n ma yunubie nun Isirayila ɲama xa yunubie masen a bɛ. N man naxa n Marigi Alatala maxandi a xa geya sɛniyɛnxi bɛ. <verse eid="DAN 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DAN 9:21" />N to nu na Ala maxandife, Yibirila, n malekɛ naxan to n ma xiye singe kui naxa fa a gi ra keli koore ma nunmare sɛrɛxɛ ba tɛmui. <verse eid="DAN 9:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DAN 9:22" />A naxa n xaran yi wɔyɛnyi ra, «Daniyɛli n bara fa yakɔsi alako i xa fahaamui sɔtɔ. <verse eid="DAN 9:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DAN 9:23" />I to Ala maxandi fɔlɔ tun, Ala naxa n xɛɛ alako n xa masenyi ti i bɛ, barima Ala xanuntenyi nan na i ra. I xa yi wɔyɛnyi ramɛ, i xa yi laamatunyi fahaamu.»<verse eid="DAN 9:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="DAN 9:24" />«Ala bara natɛ tongo</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DAN 9:24">i xa ɲama nun i xa taa sɛniyɛnxi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DAN 9:24">xa lu konyiya kui lɔxɔxun tongo solofere bun ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DAN 9:24">alako e xa fe ɲaaxie nun e xa yunubie xa dan.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DAN 9:24">Na waxati bun ma e e xa yunubi sare fima nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DAN 9:24">e Ala xa tinxinyi sɔtɔ naxan mu ɲɔnma abadan.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DAN 9:24">Na kui, laamatunyi nun namiɲɔnmɛ xa wɔyɛnyi kamalima nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DAN 9:24">Ala man gbilen a xa yire sɛniyɛnxi.<verse eid="DAN 9:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="DAN 9:25" />I xa a kolon, i xa a fahaamu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DAN 9:25">Darisalamu tife yaamari ma tɛmui naxɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DAN 9:25">han mangɛ sugandixi fa tɛmui,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DAN 9:25">lɔxɔxun solofere nan dangima.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DAN 9:25">Beenun lɔxɔxun tongo senni nun firin xa dangi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DAN 9:25">taa nun a tɛtɛ fama nɛ tide,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DAN 9:25">hali na fa rabama tɔɔrɛ nan na.<verse eid="DAN 9:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="DAN 9:26" />Na lɔxɔxun tongo senni nun firin dangi xanbi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DAN 9:26">e Ala xa mixi sugandixi faxama nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DAN 9:26">mixi yo mu a xun mafalama.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DAN 9:26">Na dangi xanbi, mangɛ nde xa ɲama fama nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DAN 9:26">a na taa nun na yire sɛniyɛnxi kana.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DAN 9:26">Na gbaloe mixie tɛrɛnnama nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DAN 9:26">alɔ banbaranyi mixie tɛrɛnnama ki naxɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DAN 9:26">Gere ɲaaxi mu ɲɔnma han a ɲɔn waxati naxan natɛxi.<verse eid="DAN 9:26" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="DAN 9:27" />Na mangɛ fama nɛ saatɛ xiride a tan nun mixi gbegbe tagi lɔxɔxun keren bun ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DAN 9:27">Na lɔxɔxun tagi, a tɔnyi dɔxɔma nɛ sɛrɛxɛ bafe ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DAN 9:27">A xa kanɛ kamalima fe raharamuxi ɲaaxi ndee nan na.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DAN 9:27">A luma nɛ na fe birin kui han a faxa tɛmui, alɔ a natɛxi ki naxɛ.»<verse eid="DAN 9:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DAN 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="DAN 10" />
  <para style="s">Daniyɛli xa xiye saxan nde</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DAN 10:1" />Perise mangɛ Sirusi xa mangɛya ɲɛ saxan nde ra, Ala naxa masenyi nde so Daniyɛli yi ra, naxan xili Beletesasari. Masenyi hagigɛ nan nu na ra, a gere belebele nan ma fe masenma. Daniyɛli naxa na mɛ, a na xiye fahaamu.<verse eid="DAN 10:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="DAN 10:2" />Na tɛmui, n tan Daniyɛli, n naxa lɔxɔxun saxan naba sunnunyi kui. <verse eid="DAN 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DAN 10:3" />N mu donse fanyi yo don, n mu sube don, n mu wɛni min, n mu ture xiri ɲɔxunmɛ yo maso n ma, han na lɔxɔxun saxan kamali tɛmui naxɛ.<verse eid="DAN 10:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="DAN 10:4" />Kike singe xi mɔxɔɲɛn nun naani nde ra, n nu na Tigiri xure dɛ ra. <verse eid="DAN 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DAN 10:5" />N to n ya rakeli, n naxa mixi nde to, dugi fiixɛ fanyi ragoroxi a ma, a tagi ixirixi bɛlɛti xɛɛma daaxi ra naxan keli Ufasi. <verse eid="DAN 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DAN 10:6" />A fate nu yanbama alɔ diyaman gɛmɛ, a yatagi alɔ seyamakɔnyi, a yae alɔ tɛ, a bɛlɛxɛe nun a sanyie alɔ yɔxui fanyi. A xui nu luxi nɛ alɔ galanyi.<verse eid="DAN 10:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="DAN 10:7" />N tan, Daniyɛli, n keren nan na laamatunyi toxi. Mixi naxee nu na n sɛɛti ma, e mu laamatunyi to, kɔnɔ gaaxui naxa e suxu, e naxa e gi, e sa e nɔxun. <verse eid="DAN 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DAN 10:8" />N naxa lu naa n keren. N to na laamatunyi fanyi to, n naxa matu a ra, n yatagi fan naxa masara. <verse eid="DAN 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DAN 10:9" />N to na mixi wɔyɛn xui mɛ, n naxa n felen bɔxi ma, n dɛ naxa ixara. <verse eid="DAN 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DAN 10:10" />Bɛlɛxɛ nde to din n na, n naxa n felen, n xinbi nun n bɛlɛxɛe xun na, kɔnɔ n fate birin nu sɛrɛnfe n ma.<verse eid="DAN 10:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="DAN 10:11" />A naxa a masen n bɛ, «Daniyɛli, mixi xanuxi, i xa n ma masenyi fahaamu. Keli, i ti, barima n xɛɛxi i tan nan ma.» A to na fala n bɛ, n naxa keli n sɛrɛnfe ra. <verse eid="DAN 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DAN 10:12" />A naxa a masen n bɛ, «Daniyɛli i naxa gaaxu, barima i to wa fahaamui fenfe yɛtɛ magoroe kui Ala ya i, Ala bara i xa maxandi suxu. N faxi be na nan ma. <verse eid="DAN 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DAN 10:13" />Kɔnɔ Sentanɛ xa malekɛ naxan na Perise bɔxi ma, a naxa ti n ya ra xi mɔxɔɲɛn nun keren, han Mikayeli, Ala xa malekɛe xa mangɛ xungbe nde, naxa fa n malide. Na kui n bara bu Perise mangɛe yire, <verse eid="DAN 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DAN 10:14" />kɔnɔ yakɔsi n bara fa i rakolonde fe ma naxan fama rabade i xa ɲama ra tɛmui naxan sa fama, barima laamatunyi keren luxi na waxati xa fe ra.»<verse eid="DAN 10:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="DAN 10:15" />A to nu na wɔyɛnfe n bɛ, n naxa n yatagi rafelen bɔxi ma, n dundu yen. <verse eid="DAN 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DAN 10:16" />Na xanbi, adamadi maniyɛ nde naxa fa, a a bɛlɛxɛ din n dɛ kiri ra. N naxa n dɛ rabi, n fa a fala na bɛ, «N marigi, na laamatunyi bara n yatagi masara, a n matu a ra. <verse eid="DAN 10:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DAN 10:17" />N tan i xa konyi di wɔyɛnma n marigi ra di? N sɛnbɛ birin bara ɲɔn, ɲɛngife yati bara xɔrɔxɔ n bɛ.»<verse eid="DAN 10:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="DAN 10:18" />Na tɛmui na adamadi maniyɛ naxa a bɛlɛxɛ din n na a firin nde ra, n fa sɛnbɛ sɔtɔ. <verse eid="DAN 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DAN 10:19" />A naxa a masen n bɛ, «Ala Xanuntenyi, i naxa gaaxu, i bɔɲɛ xa sa. Limaniya gben, i i sɛnbɛ so.» A to na fala n bɛ, n naxa sɛnbɛ sɔtɔ keren na. N naxa a fala a bɛ, «N marigi, i xa i xa masenyi ti n bɛ, barima n bara sɛnbɛ sɔtɔ i saabui ra.»<verse eid="DAN 10:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="DAN 10:20" />A naxa a masen n bɛ, «N faxi i yire fe naxan ma i a kolon? Yakɔsi n xa gbilen, n xa sa Perise mangɛ gere. N na siga, Girɛki mangɛ fama nɛ. <verse eid="DAN 10:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DAN 10:21" />Wo xa mangɛ Mikayeli gbansan na n malife na gere kui. Kɔnɔ beenu n xa siga, n xa nɔndi buki masenyi masen i bɛ.»<verse eid="DAN 10:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DAN 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="DAN 11" />
  <para style="s">Malekɛ xa masenyi Daniyɛli bɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DAN 11:1" />«N to nu na Mede mangɛ Dariyusi malife a xa mangɛya ɲɛ singe ra. <verse eid="DAN 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DAN 11:2" />Yakɔsi n xa nɔndi fala i bɛ. Mangɛ saxan fama nɛ Perise yamaride. Mangɛ naani nde fama nɛ naafuli gbegbe sɔtɔde dangife booree ra. A na sɛnbɛ sɔtɔ tɛmui naxɛ a naafuli ki ma, a kelima nɛ Girɛki mangɛya xili ma.»<verse eid="DAN 11:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="DAN 11:3" />«Kɔnɔ mangɛ sɛnbɛma nde fama nɛ kelide, a bɔxi yamari sɛnbɛ belebele ra. Naxan yo a kɛnɛn, a na rabama nɛ. <verse eid="DAN 11:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DAN 11:4" />Kɔnɔ na dangi xanbi, a xa mangɛya fama nɛ kanade, a rayensen duniɲa birin ma. A mu luma a bɔnsɔɛ bɛ, a mu findima mangɛya sɛnbɛma ra alɔ a singe. A xa mangɛya bama nɛ a yi ra, a lu mixi gbɛtɛe bɛ.»<verse eid="DAN 11:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="DAN 11:5" />«Mangɛ naxan na yirefanyi ma, na findima nɛ sɛnbɛma ra, kɔnɔ a xa mangɛdi nde fa sɛnbɛ sɔtɔde dangife a tan na, a bɔxi yamari nɔɛ xungbe ra.»<verse eid="DAN 11:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="DAN 11:6" />«Ɲɛ ndee na dangi, mangɛ naxan na yirefanyi ma, a fama nɛ a xa di ginɛ fide mangɛ ma naxan na kɔɔla ma, alako saatɛ xa lu e tagi. Kɔnɔ na ginɛ sɛnbɛ mu a ikuyama. A tan yo, a xa mɔri yo, a baba yo, nun a xa mixi birin bɔnɔma nɛ. <verse eid="DAN 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DAN 11:7" />Na ginɛ xa di nde fama nɛ kelide, a fa findi a baba ɲɔxɔɛ ra. A fama nɛ nɔde na mangɛ ra naxan na kɔɔla ma, a findi sɛnbɛma ra. <verse eid="DAN 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DAN 11:8" />A e xa kuyee nun e xa xɛɛma nun gbeti birin xaninma nɛ Misira bɔxi ma. A makuyama nɛ kɔɔla mangɛ ra ɲɛ ndee bun ma. <verse eid="DAN 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DAN 11:9" />Mangɛ naxan na kɔɔla ma, na yirefanyi mangɛ gerema nɛ, a fa gbilenma a xɔnyi.»<verse eid="DAN 11:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="DAN 11:10" />«Na mangɛ naxan na kɔɔla ma, na xa die sɔɔri gbegbe malanma nɛ, e xa gere ti a ifure ra alɔ banbaranyi dinma bɔxi ra ki naxɛ. E fama nɛ gere ti ra han e tan nun e yaxuie xa naaninyi ra. Na dangi xanbi, e man gbilenma nɛ e xɔnyi. <verse eid="DAN 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DAN 11:11" />Mangɛ naxan na yirefanyi ma, na fama nɛ xɔnɔde, a mini kɔɔla mangɛ xili ma, sɔɔri gbegbe na naxan yi ra. A na nɔ na sɔɔri gali ra tɛmui naxɛ, <verse eid="DAN 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DAN 11:12" />a e xaninma nɛ konyiya kui. A a yɛtɛ igboma nɛ na xa fe ra. A sɔɔri wulu wulu faxama nɛ, kɔnɔ a mu xunnakeli yo sɔtɔma.»<verse eid="DAN 11:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="DAN 11:13" />«Mangɛ naxan na kɔɔla ma, a sɔɔri gbegbe malanma nɛ dangife a naxan singe malan na. Ɲɛ ndee na dangi, a man gere tima nɛ sɔɔri nun naafuli gbegbe ra. <verse eid="DAN 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DAN 11:14" />Mixi gbegbe fama nɛ kelide yirefanyi mangɛ xili ma. I xa mixi kalabante ndee kelima nɛ alako laamatunyi xa kamali, kɔnɔ a mu sɔɔnɛyama e bɛ. <verse eid="DAN 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DAN 11:15" />Mangɛ naxan kelima kɔɔla ma, a bɛndɛ malanma nɛ tɛtɛ sɛɛti ma alako a xa nɔ taa makantaxi masɔtɔde. Boore xa sɔɔri fanyie mu nɔma e yɛtɛ makantade, e fama lude e yaxuie nan bɛlɛxɛ. <verse eid="DAN 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DAN 11:16" />Mangɛ naxan kelima kɔɔla ma, na fama nɛ a waxɔnfe birin nabade a yaxuie ra. A na ti na bɔxi tofanyi ma, a wama naxan yo rabafe, a nɔma nɛ na ra.»<verse eid="DAN 11:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="DAN 11:17" />«A natɛ tongoma nɛ a xa na bɔxi yamari a sɛnbɛ birin na, a lanyi xiri a nun na mangɛ. A a xa di ginɛ nde soma nɛ a yi ra, alako a xa nɔ na mangɛya sɔtɔde, kɔnɔ na mu sɔɔnɛyama. <verse eid="DAN 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DAN 11:18" />Na dangi xanbi, a katama nɛ bɔxie sɔtɔde naxee na baa dɛ ra. A ndee sɔtɔma nɛ, kɔnɔ sɔɔri mangɛ nde a xa yɛtɛ igboɲa kanama nɛ, a a rayaagi. <verse eid="DAN 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DAN 11:19" />Na nan a niyama, a gbilen a xɔnyi, a xa taa makantaxie na dɛnnaxɛ. Na kui a sɛnbɛ kanama nɛ, a bira, a mu kelima sɔnɔn.»<verse eid="DAN 11:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="DAN 11:20" />«Mangɛ naxan tima na xanbi ra, na duuti maxili ɲaaxi nde xɛɛma nɛ bɔxi yire nde ma, dɛnnaxɛ tofan a birin bɛ. A mu buma, na mangɛ fan birama nɛ, kɔnɔ a xa birɛ mu fatanma gere xa ra, xa na mu a ra xɔnnanteya.»<verse eid="DAN 11:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="DAN 11:21" />«Mixi ɲaaxi nde tima nɛ a ɲɔxɔɛ ra, naxan mu fatanxi mangɛ xabilɛ ra. A soma nɛ bɔxi ra bɔɲɛsa tɛmui, a mangɛya masɔtɔ yanfanteya ra. <verse eid="DAN 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DAN 11:22" />Sɔɔri gali katama nɛ nɔde a ra, kɔnɔ a e birin faxama nɛ, e tan nun mangɛ saatɛ na e nun naxan tagi. <verse eid="DAN 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DAN 11:23" />A tan nun naxee yo saata, a fama nɛ nee yanfade. Na kui, hali a xa gali mu gbo, a sɛnbɛ sɔtɔma nɛ. <verse eid="DAN 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="DAN 11:24" />A man soma nɛ bɔxi fanyie kui, a naafuli birin ba bannae yi ra, a a so a xa mixie yi ra. A fe rabama nɛ a babae nun a benbae singe mu nu naxan naba. A na birin nabama yanfanteya nan na waxati nde bun ma.»<verse eid="DAN 11:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="DAN 11:25" />«A sɔɔri gali belebele rakelima nɛ, e xa a sɛnbɛ masen yirefanyi mangɛ bɛ. Sɔɔri gali belebele luma nɛ na mangɛ fan yi ra, kɔnɔ e mu tima kɔɔla mangɛ ya ra yanfanteya saabui ra. <verse eid="DAN 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="DAN 11:26" />Mangɛ naxan kelima yire fanyi ma, a xa mixie nan yati fama a yanfade. A yaxuie geenima nɛ, e a xa sɔɔri gbegbe faxa. <verse eid="DAN 11:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="DAN 11:27" />Na mangɛ firinyi fama nɛ lude yire keren, e xa e boore tɔɔrɔ. E wule falama nɛ e boore bɛ, kɔnɔ e bore faxafe mu sɔɔnɛyama han waxati sugandixi xa a li. <verse eid="DAN 11:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="DAN 11:28" />Kɔɔla mangɛ gbilenma nɛ a xɔnyi a nun naafuli belebele ra. A kelima nɛ saatɛ sɛniyɛnxi xili ma, a fa gbilen.»<verse eid="DAN 11:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="DAN 11:29" />«Waxati na kamali, a man sigama nɛ yirefanyi ma gere sode. Kɔnɔ yi biyaasi mu luma alɔ a singe. <verse eid="DAN 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="DAN 11:30" />Mixie fama nɛ kunkuie kui a gerede kelife sogegorode. E na nɔ a ra, a man gbilen a xɔnyi. A xa xɔnɛ kui, a fe ɲaaxi rabama nɛ mixie ra naxee na saatɛ sɛniyɛnxi kui, kɔnɔ naxee na saatɛ sɛniyɛnxi rabɛɲin, a fe fanyi rabama nɛ nee tan bɛ.»<verse eid="DAN 11:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="DAN 11:31" />«A sɔɔrie yamarima nɛ, e xa hɔrɔmɔbanxi kana. Na kui sɛrɛxɛ mu bama lɔxɔɛ birin alɔ a nu darixi raba ra ki naxɛ. Yaxuie fama nɛ fe haramuxi rabade mɛnni. <verse eid="DAN 11:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="DAN 11:32" />A saatɛ kanɛe sɔtɔma nɛ wule matɔxɔɛ ra, kɔnɔ naxee tan e Marigi Ala kolon, nee tondima nɛ. <verse eid="DAN 11:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="DAN 11:33" />Lɔnnilae ɲama xaranma nɛ, kɔnɔ e yaxuie fa e faxade santidɛgɛma nun tɛ ra, xa na mu a ra e e xanin konyiya kui, e e xa se birin ba e yi ra. <verse eid="DAN 11:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="DAN 11:34" />Ndee fama nɛ lɔnnilae malide, kɔnɔ a gbegbe e yanfama nɛ. <verse eid="DAN 11:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="DAN 11:35" />Lɔnnila ndee birama nɛ, alako e xa sɛniyɛn tɔɔrɛ saabui ra beenun waxati xa kamali.»<verse eid="DAN 11:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="DAN 11:36" />«Na mangɛ fama nɛ a waxɔnfe rabade. A a yɛtɛ itema nɛ, a a yɛtɛ igbo dangife alae birin na, a wɔyɛnyi magaaxuxi fala Ala xili ma, naxan gbo alae birin bɛ. A na fe mɔɔli birin nabama nɛ han Ala xa xɔnɛ xa waxati xa kamali. <verse eid="DAN 11:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="DAN 11:37" />A mu ala yo binyama, hali a babae gbee nun a xa ginɛe gbee. A mu ala yo binyama barima a a yɛtɛ igboma nɛ dangife e birin na. <verse eid="DAN 11:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="DAN 11:38" />A xa taa makantaxie findima nɛ a xa alae ra, a fa e batu xɛɛma, gbeti, gɛmɛ tofanyie, nun naafuli mɔɔli birin na. A babae mu nu darixi na fe mɔɔli ra. <verse eid="DAN 11:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="DAN 11:39" />A gere tima bɔnsɔɛ nde xa ala nan xa mali ra. A mixi binyama nɛ naxan a yɛtɛ magoroma a bɛ, a a niya mixi gbegbe xa lu e fan bun ma. A bɔxie itaxunma nɛ mixie ma naxee kɔbiri soma a yi ra.»<verse eid="DAN 11:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="DAN 11:40" />«Waxati dɔnxɔɛ na a li, yirefanyi mangɛ kelima nɛ kɔɔla mangɛ xili ma. Mangɛ fama nɛ kelide kɔɔla ma, a din boore ra alɔ banbaranyi dinma bɔxi ra ki naxɛ. Sɔɔri ragisee, soe ragie, nun kunkui gbegbe na a yi ra. <verse eid="DAN 11:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="DAN 11:41" />A fama nɛ bɔxi ma dɛnnaxɛ tofan dangi bɔxi birin na, mixi wuyaxi halaki, kɔnɔ Edon, Mowaba, nun Amoni kuntigie e yɛtɛ sɔtɔma nɛ. <verse eid="DAN 11:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="DAN 11:42" />Bɔxi gbegbe luma nɛ a xa nɔɛ bun ma, hali Misira, a mu nɔma a yɛtɛ sɔtɔde a yi. <verse eid="DAN 11:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="DAN 11:43" />A Misira xɛɛma, gbeti, nun naafuli birin tongoma nɛ. Libiyakae nun Etiyopikae fan birama nɛ a fɔxɔ ra. <verse eid="DAN 11:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="DAN 11:44" />Kɔnɔ xibaaru naxan kelima sogetede nun kɔɔla biri ra, na fama nɛ a magaaxude han a siga a bɔɲɛ texi ra, a xa ɲama wuyaxi halaki. <verse eid="DAN 11:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="DAN 11:45" />A a xa mangɛ leele tima baae nan longori ra, geya sɛniyɛnxi mabiri naxan tofan geya birin bɛ. Faxɛ a tɛrɛnnama mɛnni nɛ, mixi yo mu fa a malide.»<verse eid="DAN 11:45" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DAN 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="DAN 12" />
  <para style="s">Malekɛ xa masenyi raɲɔnyi</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DAN 12:1" />«Na waxati, malekɛ mangɛ Mikayeli kelima nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DAN 12:1">malekɛ naxan i xa ɲama makantama.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DAN 12:1">Na findima waxati xɔrɔxɔɛ nan na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DAN 12:1">naxan maniyɛ singe mu nu to,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DAN 12:1">kabi ɲamanɛe fɔlɛ han yakɔsi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DAN 12:1">Na waxati, naxee xilie sɛbɛxi buki kui,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DAN 12:1">e kisi sɔtɔma nɛ.<verse eid="DAN 12:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="DAN 12:2" />Mixi gbegbe naxee faxaxi e na gaburi kui,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DAN 12:2">e kelima nɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DAN 12:2">Ndee sigama nɛ ariyanna,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DAN 12:2">ndee siga yahannama yaagi kui.<verse eid="DAN 12:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="DAN 12:3" />Lɔnnilae yanbama nɛ alɔ koore xɔri,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DAN 12:3">karamɔxɔ tinxinxi naxee ɲama rafama tinxinyi ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DAN 12:3">nee yanbama nɛ alɔ tunbuie,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DAN 12:3">naxee mu xubenma abadan.»<verse eid="DAN 12:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="DAN 12:4" />«Daniyɛli, i xa yi masenyi findi gundo ra. Yi buki ragali han waxati raɲɔnyi. Na tɛmui mixi gbegbe a xaranma nɛ, e xa fahaamui xun masa.»<verse eid="DAN 12:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="DAN 12:5" />N tan Daniyɛli, n naxa xɛmɛ gbɛtɛ firin to xiye kui. Keren tixi xure dɛ ra be biri, boore tixi naakiri ma. <verse eid="DAN 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DAN 12:6" />Keren naxa xɛmɛ maxɔrin naxan nu na xure xun ma, dugi fiixɛ ragoroxi naxan ma, «Na fe magaaxuxie ɲɔnma tɛmui mundun?»<verse eid="DAN 12:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="DAN 12:7" />Dugi fiixɛ kanyi, naxan nu tixi xure xun ma, na naxa a bɛlɛxɛ firinyie ite koore ma, a fa a fala, «N bara n kali Ala xili ra naxan na abadan, yi fe xa bui, waxati saxan nun a tagi nan a ra. A fama kamalide ɲama sɛniyɛnxi sɛnbɛ na ɲɔn tɛmui naxɛ.» <verse eid="DAN 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DAN 12:8" />N na mɛ nɛ, kɔnɔ n mu a fahaamu. N naxa a maxɔrin, «N marigi, yi fe ɲɔnma di?» <verse eid="DAN 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DAN 12:9" />A naxa n yaabi, «Daniyɛli, siga, barima yi masenyi gundo na a ra, a nɔxunxi han waxati raɲɔnyi. <verse eid="DAN 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DAN 12:10" />Mixi wuyaxi sɛniyɛnma nɛ, e fiixɛ, nɔxɔɛ birin ba e ma. Kɔnɔ mixi ɲaaxie mu sese fahaamuma, e luma nɛ fe ɲaaxi raba ra. Lɔnnilae tan fahaamui sɔtɔma nɛ.»<verse eid="DAN 12:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="DAN 12:11" />«Lɔxɔ yo lɔxɔ sɛrɛxɛ dan tɛmui ma, han fe raharamuxi dɔnxɔɛ raba tɛmui, xi wulu keren, xi kɛmɛ firin tongo solomanaani nan na e tagi. <verse eid="DAN 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DAN 12:12" />Sɛɛwɛ na mixi bɛ naxan a tunnabɛxima han xi wulu keren, xi kɛmɛ saxan, xi tongo saxan a nun suuli xa kamali. <verse eid="DAN 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DAN 12:13" />I tan Daniyɛli, i xa i tunnabɛxi han a ɲɔnma tɛmui naxɛ. Na tɛmui i fama nɛ i malabude, i man gbilen keli ra alako i xa i kɛ sɔtɔ saamin ti lɔxɔɛ.»<verse eid="DAN 12:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DAN 12" />
</usx>